WEBVTT

00:00:53.749 --> 00:00:55.185
[CLICKING]

00:00:57.492 --> 00:00:58.536
[FZZT]

00:01:01.148 --> 00:01:02.279
[FZZT]

00:01:04.890 --> 00:01:05.978
[FZZT]

00:01:08.764 --> 00:01:10.157
[FZZT]

00:01:13.769 --> 00:01:14.770
[FZZT]

00:01:16.511 --> 00:01:17.947
[CLICK]

00:01:17.990 --> 00:01:20.254
[CAT MEOWS]

00:01:20.297 --> 00:01:23.083
I SHOULD HAVE KNOWN
THAT YOU WOULD BE HERE...

00:01:23.126 --> 00:01:25.868
PROFESSOR McGONAGALL.

00:01:35.225 --> 00:01:36.618
[FOOTSTEPS]

00:01:36.661 --> 00:01:40.230
GOOD EVENING,
PROFESSOR DUMBLEDORE.

00:01:42.319 --> 00:01:45.453
ARE THE RUMORS TRUE,
ALBUS?

00:01:45.496 --> 00:01:48.151
I'M AFRAID SO,
PROFESSOR.

00:01:48.195 --> 00:01:51.154
THE GOOD AND THE BAD.

00:01:51.198 --> 00:01:52.851
AND THE BOY?

00:01:52.895 --> 00:01:54.897
HAGRID IS BRINGING HIM.

00:01:54.940 --> 00:01:57.073
DO YOU THINK IT WISE
TO TRUST HAGRID

00:01:57.117 --> 00:01:58.814
WITH SOMETHING AS
IMPORTANT AS THIS?

00:01:58.857 --> 00:02:03.166
AH, PROFESSOR, I WOULD
TRUST HAGRID WITH MY LIFE.

00:02:03.210 --> 00:02:05.212
[ENGINE WHINING]

00:02:14.177 --> 00:02:17.833
[TIRES SCREECH]

00:02:22.925 --> 00:02:24.492
PROFESSOR DUMBLEDORE, SIR.

00:02:24.535 --> 00:02:27.277
PROFESSOR McGONAGALL.

00:02:27.321 --> 00:02:29.323
NO PROBLEMS I TRUST,
HAGRID?

00:02:29.366 --> 00:02:31.194
NO, SIR.

00:02:31.238 --> 00:02:32.891
LITTLE TYKE
FELL ASLEEP

00:02:32.935 --> 00:02:34.980
JUST AS WE WERE
FLYING OVER BRISTOL.

00:02:35.024 --> 00:02:36.373
HEH.

00:02:36.417 --> 00:02:39.594
TRY NOT TO WAKE HIM.

00:02:39.637 --> 00:02:41.204
THERE YOU GO.

00:02:46.949 --> 00:02:50.474
ALBUS, DO YOU REALLY
THINK IT'S SAFE,

00:02:50.518 --> 00:02:52.259
LEAVING HIM
WITH THESE PEOPLE?

00:02:52.302 --> 00:02:53.695
I'VE WATCHED THEM
ALL DAY.

00:02:53.738 --> 00:02:57.394
THEY'RE THE WORST SORT
OF MUGGLES IMAGINABLE.

00:02:57.438 --> 00:02:58.743
THEY REALLY ARE--

00:02:58.787 --> 00:03:02.356
THE ONLY FAMILY HE HAS.

00:03:02.399 --> 00:03:03.705
THIS BOY WILL BE FAMOUS.

00:03:03.748 --> 00:03:06.186
THERE WON'T BE A CHILD
IN OUR WORLD

00:03:06.229 --> 00:03:07.274
WHO DOESN'T KNOW
HIS NAME.

00:03:07.317 --> 00:03:10.102
EXACTLY.
HE'S FAR BETTER OFF

00:03:10.146 --> 00:03:12.801
GROWING UP AWAY
FROM ALL OF THAT.

00:03:15.456 --> 00:03:17.675
UNTIL HE IS READY.

00:03:26.031 --> 00:03:27.903
[SNIFFLES]

00:03:27.946 --> 00:03:30.035
[CLEARS THROAT]

00:03:30.079 --> 00:03:31.950
THERE, THERE, HAGRID.

00:03:31.994 --> 00:03:34.823
IT'S NOT REALLY
GOOD-BYE, AFTER ALL.

00:03:47.488 --> 00:03:49.446
GOOD LUCK...

00:03:49.490 --> 00:03:51.840
HARRY POTTER.

00:03:57.324 --> 00:03:59.326
[THUNDER]

00:04:08.465 --> 00:04:10.075
[CLICK]

00:04:10.119 --> 00:04:12.164
Aunt Petunia:
UP. GET UP.

00:04:12.208 --> 00:04:14.558
[KNOCKING]

00:04:14.602 --> 00:04:16.778
[SIGHS] NOW!

00:04:18.910 --> 00:04:20.390
[DOOR SLAMS]

00:04:30.966 --> 00:04:34.448
Dudley: WAKE UP, COUSIN!
WE'RE GOING TO THE ZOO!

00:04:34.491 --> 00:04:37.146
[STOMPING]

00:04:38.147 --> 00:04:41.281
HA HA HA HA!

00:04:44.501 --> 00:04:49.463
Petunia: OH, HERE HE COMES,
THE BIRTHDAY BOY!

00:04:49.506 --> 00:04:50.899
Vernon:
HAPPY BIRTHDAY, SON.

00:04:50.942 --> 00:04:52.553
[GIGGLING]

00:04:52.596 --> 00:04:54.468
WHY DON'T YOU JUST
COOK THE BREAKFAST

00:04:54.511 --> 00:04:55.904
AND TRY NOT
TO BURN ANYTHING?

00:04:55.947 --> 00:04:57.035
YES, AUNT PETUNIA.

00:04:57.079 --> 00:05:00.735
I WANT EVERYTHING
TO BE PERFECT

00:05:00.778 --> 00:05:04.216
FOR MY DUDLEY'S
SPECIAL DAY!

00:05:04.260 --> 00:05:05.740
Vernon: HURRY UP!

00:05:05.783 --> 00:05:07.002
BRING MY COFFEE, BOY!

00:05:07.045 --> 00:05:08.003
YES, UNCLE VERNON.

00:05:08.046 --> 00:05:09.787
Petunia: OHH!

00:05:09.831 --> 00:05:12.660
AREN'T THEY WONDERFUL,
DARLING?

00:05:14.966 --> 00:05:17.142
HOW MANY ARE THERE?

00:05:17.186 --> 00:05:19.014
36. COUNTED THEM MYSELF.

00:05:19.057 --> 00:05:22.800
36?! BUT LAST YEAR--
LAST YEAR I HAD 37!

00:05:22.844 --> 00:05:24.324
YES, WELL,
SOME OF THEM

00:05:24.367 --> 00:05:25.673
ARE QUITE A BIT BIGGER
THAN LAST YEAR'S.

00:05:25.716 --> 00:05:27.239
I DON'T CARE
HOW BIG THEY ARE!

00:05:27.283 --> 00:05:28.980
OH, NOW, NOW, NOW, THIS IS
WHAT WE'RE GOING TO DO,

00:05:29.024 --> 00:05:30.373
IS THAT WHEN WE GO OUT

00:05:30.417 --> 00:05:32.375
WE'RE GOING TO BUY YOU
2 NEW PRESENTS.

00:05:32.419 --> 00:05:34.203
HOW'S THAT, PUMPKIN?

00:05:36.988 --> 00:05:38.903
THIS WILL BE
A LOVELY DAY AT THE ZOO.

00:05:38.947 --> 00:05:41.297
I'M REALLY LOOKING
FORWARD TO IT.

00:05:44.735 --> 00:05:46.998
I'M WARNING YOU NOW, BOY.

00:05:47.042 --> 00:05:50.654
ANY FUNNY BUSINESS,
ANY AT ALL,

00:05:50.698 --> 00:05:54.179
AND YOU WON'T HAVE
ANY MEALS FOR A WEEK.

00:05:54.223 --> 00:05:56.443
GET IN.

00:05:56.486 --> 00:05:58.488
[CHILDREN TALKING]

00:06:03.232 --> 00:06:05.147
Dudley: MAKE IT MOVE!

00:06:07.410 --> 00:06:09.543
[BANGING]
MOVE!

00:06:09.586 --> 00:06:11.283
MOVE!

00:06:11.327 --> 00:06:12.807
HE'S ASLEEP!

00:06:12.850 --> 00:06:15.157
HE'S BORING.

00:06:17.942 --> 00:06:19.422
SORRY ABOUT HIM.

00:06:19.466 --> 00:06:21.250
HE DOESN'T UNDERSTAND
WHAT IT'S LIKE,

00:06:21.293 --> 00:06:23.687
LYING THERE
DAY AFTER DAY,

00:06:23.731 --> 00:06:27.299
WATCHING PEOPLE PRESS
THEIR UGLY FACES IN ON YOU.

00:06:30.346 --> 00:06:32.217
CAN YOU HEAR ME?

00:06:35.482 --> 00:06:40.008
IT'S JUST...I'VE NEVER
TALKED TO A SNAKE BEFORE.

00:06:40.051 --> 00:06:43.141
DO YOU...I MEAN...

00:06:43.185 --> 00:06:45.230
DO YOU TALK
TO PEOPLE OFTEN?

00:06:47.189 --> 00:06:48.930
YOU'RE FROM BURMA,
AREN'T YOU?

00:06:48.973 --> 00:06:50.453
WAS IT NICE THERE?

00:06:50.497 --> 00:06:51.889
DO YOU MISS YOUR FAMILY?

00:06:55.589 --> 00:06:58.983
I SEE.
THAT'S ME AS WELL.

00:06:59.027 --> 00:07:00.768
I NEVER KNEW
MY PARENTS, EITHER.

00:07:00.811 --> 00:07:02.552
MUMMY, DAD, COME HERE!

00:07:02.596 --> 00:07:04.511
YOU WON'T BELIEVE WHAT
THIS SNAKE IS DOING!

00:07:08.906 --> 00:07:10.734
WHOA! AAH!

00:07:10.778 --> 00:07:12.693
AAH!

00:07:13.911 --> 00:07:15.913
[SPUTTERING]

00:07:28.535 --> 00:07:31.146
THANKS-S-S.

00:07:31.189 --> 00:07:32.800
ANYTIME.

00:07:35.716 --> 00:07:36.847
Man: SNAKE!

00:07:36.891 --> 00:07:37.848
[HISSES]

00:07:37.892 --> 00:07:39.763
[SCREAMING]

00:07:53.342 --> 00:07:54.299
MUM! MUMMY!

00:07:54.343 --> 00:07:55.518
AAH!

00:07:55.562 --> 00:07:56.780
MUM, HELP ME!
HELP ME!

00:07:56.824 --> 00:07:58.565
MY DARLING BOY!

00:07:58.608 --> 00:08:00.131
HOW DID YOU
GET IN THERE?

00:08:00.175 --> 00:08:01.481
[GIGGLING]

00:08:01.524 --> 00:08:04.701
HOW DID YOU
GET IN THERE?

00:08:04.745 --> 00:08:06.355
[DUDLEY CRYING]

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:11.621
IT'S ALL RIGHT,
SWEETHEART.

00:08:11.665 --> 00:08:13.057
IT'S ALL RIGHT.

00:08:13.101 --> 00:08:15.582
WE'LL GET YOU OUT OF THESE
TERRIBLY COLD CLOTHES.

00:08:17.192 --> 00:08:18.715
OW!
WHAT HAPPENED?

00:08:18.759 --> 00:08:20.848
I SWEAR, I DON'T KNOW!GRR!

00:08:20.891 --> 00:08:22.153
ONE MINUTE,
THE GLASS WAS THERE,

00:08:22.197 --> 00:08:23.981
AND THEN IT WAS GONE!
IT WAS LIKE MAGIC!

00:08:24.025 --> 00:08:25.766
[SCOFFS]

00:08:28.551 --> 00:08:31.859
THERE'S NO SUCH THING
AS MAGIC!

00:08:31.902 --> 00:08:33.513
[SLAM]

00:08:38.300 --> 00:08:39.388
[SCREECH]

00:09:08.678 --> 00:09:11.376
Vernon: OH, MARGE IS ILL.
ATE A FUNNY WHELK.

00:09:11.420 --> 00:09:13.204
DAD, LOOK,
HARRY'S GOT A LETTER!

00:09:13.248 --> 00:09:14.902
HEY, GIVE IT BACK!
IT'S MINE!

00:09:14.945 --> 00:09:17.861
YOURS?
WHO'D BE WRITING TO YOU?

00:09:25.782 --> 00:09:27.392
[GULP]

00:09:37.054 --> 00:09:39.753
[SCREECHING]

00:09:46.107 --> 00:09:49.066
[DRILL WHIRRING]

00:09:51.460 --> 00:09:53.201
Vernon: ...LETTER BOX.

00:09:53.244 --> 00:09:55.595
[CREAKING]

00:09:55.638 --> 00:09:57.597
[DRILL WHIRRING]

00:10:00.817 --> 00:10:02.819
[SCREECHING]

00:10:05.039 --> 00:10:08.477
Petunia: HAVE A LOVELY DAY
AT THE OFFICE, DEAR.

00:10:08.520 --> 00:10:10.261
[OWLS SCREECHING]

00:10:11.262 --> 00:10:14.004
SHOO! GO ON!

00:10:36.984 --> 00:10:38.638
[SIGHS]

00:10:38.681 --> 00:10:41.945
FINE DAY, SUNDAY.

00:10:41.989 --> 00:10:44.556
IN MY OPINION,
BEST DAY OF THE WEEK.

00:10:44.600 --> 00:10:46.123
WHY IS THAT, DUDLEY?

00:10:47.168 --> 00:10:49.300
'CAUSE THERE'S
NO POST ON SUNDAYS?

00:10:49.344 --> 00:10:51.302
RIGHT YOU ARE, HARRY.

00:10:51.346 --> 00:10:53.740
NO POST ON SUNDAYS. HA!

00:10:55.524 --> 00:10:58.701
Vernon:
NO BLASTED LETTERS TODAY!

00:10:58.745 --> 00:11:03.140
NO, SIR! NOT ONE
SINGLE BLOODY LETTER!

00:11:03.184 --> 00:11:04.707
NOT ONE!

00:11:04.751 --> 00:11:06.535
[OWLS CHITTERING]

00:11:13.934 --> 00:11:18.025
NO, SIR! NOT ONE
BLASTED, MISERABLE--

00:11:20.114 --> 00:11:21.898
[FLUTTERING]

00:11:21.942 --> 00:11:23.944
[RUMBLING]

00:11:28.339 --> 00:11:31.778
Dudley: AAH! MAKE IT STOP!
PLEASE MAKE IT STOP!

00:11:33.431 --> 00:11:34.911
STOP IT! STOP IT!

00:11:34.955 --> 00:11:36.304
WHAT IS IT?!

00:11:36.347 --> 00:11:39.437
[PETUNIA SCREAMING]

00:11:39.481 --> 00:11:41.135
Dudley: PLEASE TELL ME
WHAT'S HAPPENING!

00:11:41.178 --> 00:11:45.139
Vernon:
GO AWAY! AAH!

00:11:45.182 --> 00:11:47.141
GIVE ME THAT!

00:11:47.184 --> 00:11:50.231
GIVE ME THAT LETTER!

00:11:52.363 --> 00:11:53.364
GET OFF!

00:11:53.408 --> 00:11:56.498
AAH!
AAH!

00:11:56.541 --> 00:11:57.673
AAH!

00:11:57.717 --> 00:12:01.808
THEY'RE MY LETTERS!
LET GO OF ME!

00:12:03.157 --> 00:12:06.334
THAT'S IT!
WE'RE GOING AWAY!

00:12:06.377 --> 00:12:08.466
FAR AWAY!

00:12:08.510 --> 00:12:10.773
WHERE THEY CAN'T FIND US!

00:12:10.817 --> 00:12:13.167
DADDY'S GONE MAD,
HASN'T HE?

00:12:16.039 --> 00:12:18.041
[THUNDER]

00:12:45.677 --> 00:12:48.593
[BEEPING]

00:12:48.637 --> 00:12:50.421
MAKE A WISH, HARRY.

00:12:51.553 --> 00:12:53.381
[BLOWS]

00:12:53.424 --> 00:12:55.426
[BANG]

00:12:56.601 --> 00:12:57.689
[BANG]

00:12:59.039 --> 00:13:00.605
[BANG]

00:13:01.911 --> 00:13:03.870
[BANG]

00:13:03.913 --> 00:13:06.611
[BANG]

00:13:06.655 --> 00:13:08.135
WHO'S THERE?

00:13:08.178 --> 00:13:09.614
[BANG]

00:13:10.572 --> 00:13:12.661
AAH!
AAH!

00:13:21.148 --> 00:13:22.976
SORRY ABOUT THAT.

00:13:26.370 --> 00:13:29.069
[DOOR CREAKING]

00:13:30.592 --> 00:13:32.899
I DEMAND THAT YOU
LEAVE AT ONCE, SIR!

00:13:32.942 --> 00:13:35.553
YOU ARE BREAKING
AND ENTERING!

00:13:35.597 --> 00:13:37.425
OHH.

00:13:37.468 --> 00:13:41.298
DRY UP, DURSLEY,
YOU GREAT PRUNE.

00:13:45.999 --> 00:13:48.697
MIND, I HAVEN'T SEEN YOU
SINCE YOU WAS A BABY, HARRY,

00:13:48.740 --> 00:13:51.526
BUT YOU'RE A BIT MORE ALONG
THAN I WOULD'VE EXPECTED,

00:13:51.569 --> 00:13:53.093
PARTICULARLY
'ROUND THE MIDDLE.

00:13:53.136 --> 00:13:56.444
[GASPING]
I-I'M NOT HARRY.

00:13:59.142 --> 00:14:00.752
I--I AM.

00:14:00.796 --> 00:14:03.364
OH, WELL,
OF COURSE YOU ARE.

00:14:03.407 --> 00:14:05.801
GOT SOMETHING FOR YOU.

00:14:05.845 --> 00:14:08.195
'FRAID I MIGHT HAVE
SAT ON IT AT SOME POINT,

00:14:08.238 --> 00:14:11.502
BUT I IMAGINE IT'LL
TASTE FINE JUST THE SAME.

00:14:11.546 --> 00:14:13.896
AHH.

00:14:13.940 --> 00:14:17.595
BAKED IT MYSELF,
WORDS AND ALL. HEH.

00:14:22.774 --> 00:14:23.993
THANK YOU.

00:14:24.037 --> 00:14:26.082
IT'S NOT EVERY DAY
YOUR YOUNG MAN TURNS 11,

00:14:26.126 --> 00:14:27.649
NOW IS IT, EH?

00:14:35.004 --> 00:14:37.006
[FIRE CRACKLING]

00:14:43.099 --> 00:14:46.189
EXCUSE ME, BUT...

00:14:46.233 --> 00:14:47.669
WHO ARE YOU?

00:14:47.712 --> 00:14:49.236
RUBEUS HAGRID,

00:14:49.279 --> 00:14:52.500
KEEPER OF KEYS AND
GROUNDS AT HOGWARTS.

00:14:52.543 --> 00:14:55.155
OF COURSE, YOU'LL KNOW
ALL ABOUT HOGWARTS.

00:14:55.198 --> 00:14:56.765
SORRY, NO.

00:14:56.808 --> 00:14:59.942
NO? BLIMEY, HARRY,
DIDN'T YOU EVER WONDER

00:14:59.986 --> 00:15:01.813
WHERE YOUR MUM AND DAD
LEARNED IT ALL?

00:15:01.857 --> 00:15:03.206
LEARNED WHAT?

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:06.079
YOU'RE A WIZARD, HARRY.

00:15:07.558 --> 00:15:08.908
I'M A WHAT?

00:15:08.951 --> 00:15:11.954
A WIZARD, AND A THUMPIN'
GOOD 'UN, I'D WAGER,

00:15:11.998 --> 00:15:13.216
ONCE YOU TRAIN UP
A LITTLE.

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:16.045
NO. YOU'VE MADE A MISTAKE.
I MEAN...

00:15:16.089 --> 00:15:19.483
I...CAN'T BE
A--A WIZARD.

00:15:19.527 --> 00:15:23.661
I MEAN,
I'M JUST...HARRY.

00:15:23.705 --> 00:15:24.967
JUST HARRY.

00:15:25.011 --> 00:15:27.927
WELL, JUST HARRY,

00:15:27.970 --> 00:15:29.885
DID YOU EVER MAKE
ANYTHING HAPPEN,

00:15:29.929 --> 00:15:31.060
ANYTHING YOU
COULDN'T EXPLAIN,

00:15:31.104 --> 00:15:33.976
WHEN YOU WERE
ANGRY OR SCARED?

00:15:36.674 --> 00:15:38.198
HMM.

00:15:39.677 --> 00:15:41.897
[DUDLEY WHIMPERING]

00:15:47.990 --> 00:15:50.645
[OPENS ENVELOPE]

00:15:50.688 --> 00:15:52.647
Harry: "DEAR MR. POTTER,

00:15:52.690 --> 00:15:55.476
"WE ARE PLEASED TO INFORM YOU
THAT YOU HAVE BEEN ACCEPTED

00:15:55.519 --> 00:15:57.695
AT HOGWARTS SCHOOL OF
WITCHCRAFT AND WIZARDRY."

00:15:57.739 --> 00:16:00.307
HE WILL NOT BE GOING,
I TELL YOU!

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:01.569
WE SWORE
WHEN WE TOOK HIM IN,

00:16:01.612 --> 00:16:03.049
WE'D PUT A STOP
TO ALL THIS RUBBISH!

00:16:03.092 --> 00:16:04.572
YOU KNEW?

00:16:04.615 --> 00:16:07.575
YOU KNEW ALL ALONG,
AND YOU NEVER TOLD ME?

00:16:07.618 --> 00:16:08.924
OF COURSE WE KNEW.

00:16:08.968 --> 00:16:10.665
HOW COULD YOU NOT BE?

00:16:10.708 --> 00:16:13.973
MY PERFECTSISTER
BEING WHO SHE WAS.

00:16:14.016 --> 00:16:18.020
OH, MY MOTHER
AND FATHER WERE SO PROUD

00:16:18.064 --> 00:16:20.370
THE DAY SHE GOT
HER LETTER.

00:16:20.414 --> 00:16:22.459
"WE HAVE A WITCH
IN THE FAMILY.

00:16:22.503 --> 00:16:24.984
ISN'T IT WONDERFUL?"

00:16:25.027 --> 00:16:27.987
I WAS THE ONLY ONE TO SEE
HER FOR WHAT SHE WAS...

00:16:28.030 --> 00:16:30.946
A FREAK!

00:16:30.990 --> 00:16:32.730
AND THEN SHE MET
THAT POTTER,

00:16:32.774 --> 00:16:34.210
AND THEN SHE HAD YOU,

00:16:34.254 --> 00:16:35.864
AND I KNEW YOU WOULD
BE THE SAME,

00:16:35.907 --> 00:16:37.605
JUST AS STRANGE,

00:16:37.648 --> 00:16:40.173
JUST AS...ABNORMAL.

00:16:40.216 --> 00:16:41.696
AND THEN, IF YOU PLEASE,

00:16:41.739 --> 00:16:43.480
SHE WENT AND GOT
HERSELF BLOWN UP,

00:16:43.524 --> 00:16:45.656
AND WE GOT LANDED
WITH YOU.

00:16:45.700 --> 00:16:47.049
BLOWN UP?

00:16:47.093 --> 00:16:49.747
YOU TOLD ME MY PARENTS
DIED IN A CAR CRASH!

00:16:49.791 --> 00:16:51.314
A CAR CRASH?!

00:16:51.358 --> 00:16:54.056
A CAR CRASH KILL
LILY AND JAMES POTTER?

00:16:54.100 --> 00:16:55.101
Petunia: WE HAD
TO SAY SOMETHING.

00:16:55.144 --> 00:16:56.885
IT'S AN OUTRAGE!

00:16:56.928 --> 00:16:57.973
IT'S A SCANDAL!

00:16:58.017 --> 00:16:59.888
HE'LL NOT BE GOING.

00:16:59.931 --> 00:17:03.370
OH? AND I SUPPOSE
A GREAT MUGGLE LIKE YOURSELF

00:17:03.413 --> 00:17:04.632
IS GONNA STOP HIM,
ARE YOU?

00:17:04.675 --> 00:17:05.633
MUGGLE?

00:17:05.676 --> 00:17:07.113
NON-MAGIC FOLK.

00:17:07.156 --> 00:17:09.680
THIS BOY'S HAD HIS NAME DOWN
EVER SINCE HE WERE BORN!

00:17:09.724 --> 00:17:11.334
HE'S GOING
TO THE FINEST SCHOOL

00:17:11.378 --> 00:17:13.554
OF WITCHCRAFT AND WIZARDRY
IN THE WORLD,

00:17:13.597 --> 00:17:16.122
AND HE'LL BE UNDER
THE FINEST HEADMASTER

00:17:16.165 --> 00:17:17.993
THAT HOGWARTS
HAS EVER SEEN...

00:17:18.037 --> 00:17:20.213
ALBUS DUMBLEDORE.

00:17:20.256 --> 00:17:22.476
I'LL NOT PAY TO HAVE
SOME CRACKPOT OLD FOOL

00:17:22.519 --> 00:17:24.347
TEACH HIM MAGIC TRICKS!

00:17:24.391 --> 00:17:29.526
NEVER...INSULT
ALBUS DUMBLEDORE

00:17:29.570 --> 00:17:31.311
IN FRONT OF ME.

00:17:32.312 --> 00:17:35.010
[SLURPING]

00:17:37.882 --> 00:17:38.840
OH!

00:17:38.883 --> 00:17:41.886
[YELLING]

00:17:46.804 --> 00:17:48.806
[DUDLEY SOBBING]

00:17:49.938 --> 00:17:51.635
WELL, AHEM,
I'D APPRECIATE IT

00:17:51.679 --> 00:17:55.117
IF YOU DIDN'T TELL ANYONE
AT HOGWARTS ABOUT THAT.

00:17:55.161 --> 00:17:57.598
STRICTLY SPEAKING,
I'M NOT ALLOWED TO DO MAGIC.

00:17:57.641 --> 00:17:59.295
OK.

00:17:59.339 --> 00:18:02.385
OOH, WE'RE A BIT
BEHIND SCHEDULE.

00:18:02.429 --> 00:18:04.083
BEST BE OFF.

00:18:07.738 --> 00:18:09.827
[THUD]

00:18:09.871 --> 00:18:12.308
UNLESS YOU'D RATHER STAY,
OF COURSE.

00:18:12.352 --> 00:18:14.136
HMM?

00:18:16.486 --> 00:18:18.488
[THUNDER]

00:18:27.236 --> 00:18:30.892
Harry: "ALL STUDENTS
MUST BE EQUIPPED WITH...

00:18:30.935 --> 00:18:33.808
"ONE STANDARD
SIZE 2 PEWTER CAULDRON

00:18:33.851 --> 00:18:36.202
"AND MAY BRING,
IF THEY DESIRE,

00:18:36.245 --> 00:18:39.074
EITHER AN OWL,
A CAT, OR A TOAD."

00:18:39.118 --> 00:18:41.816
CAN WE FIND ALL THIS
IN LONDON?

00:18:41.859 --> 00:18:45.515
IF YOU KNOW WHERE TO GO.

00:18:52.131 --> 00:18:54.089
[TALKING AND LAUGHTER]

00:18:54.133 --> 00:18:56.135
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:19:07.972 --> 00:19:11.237
AH, HAGRID!
THE USUAL, I PRESUME?

00:19:11.280 --> 00:19:12.368
NO, THANKS, TOM.

00:19:12.412 --> 00:19:15.371
I'M ON OFFICIAL
HOGWARTS BUSINESS.

00:19:15.415 --> 00:19:16.894
JUST HELPING
YOUNG HARRY HERE

00:19:16.938 --> 00:19:17.895
BUY HIS SCHOOL SUPPLIES.

00:19:17.939 --> 00:19:20.028
BLESS MY SOUL.

00:19:20.071 --> 00:19:22.509
IT'S HARRY POTTER.

00:19:22.552 --> 00:19:23.988
[MUSIC STOPS]

00:19:24.032 --> 00:19:26.339
[TALKING STOPS]

00:19:26.382 --> 00:19:28.210
WELCOME BACK,
MR. POTTER.

00:19:28.254 --> 00:19:30.169
WELCOME BACK.

00:19:30.212 --> 00:19:32.083
DORIS CROCKFORD,
MR. POTTER.

00:19:32.127 --> 00:19:34.782
I CAN'T BELIEVE I'M
MEETING YOU AT LAST.

00:19:34.825 --> 00:19:37.741
[STUTTERING]
HARRY P-POTTER.

00:19:37.785 --> 00:19:38.960
C-CAN'T TELL YOU

00:19:39.003 --> 00:19:40.483
HOW PLEASED I AM
TO MEET YOU.

00:19:40.527 --> 00:19:43.094
HELLO, PROFESSOR.
I DIDN'T SEE YOU THERE.

00:19:43.138 --> 00:19:45.096
HARRY, THIS IS
PROFESSOR QUIRRELL.

00:19:45.140 --> 00:19:47.447
HE'LL BE YOUR DEFENSE
AGAINST THE DARK ARTS TEACHER

00:19:47.490 --> 00:19:48.448
AT HOGWARTS.

00:19:48.491 --> 00:19:50.189
OH. NICE TO MEET YOU.

00:19:50.232 --> 00:19:54.062
F-FEARFULLY
FASCINATING SUBJECT.

00:19:54.105 --> 00:19:59.415
N-NOT THAT YOU NEED IT,
EH, POTTER?

00:19:59.459 --> 00:20:02.375
YES, WELL,
MUST BE GOING NOW.

00:20:02.418 --> 00:20:04.246
LOTS TO BUY.

00:20:04.290 --> 00:20:05.639
GOOD-BYE.

00:20:08.859 --> 00:20:10.383
SEE, HARRY,
YOU'RE FAMOUS.

00:20:10.426 --> 00:20:12.211
BUT WHY AM I FAMOUS,
HAGRID?

00:20:12.254 --> 00:20:14.300
ALL THOSE PEOPLE
BACK THERE,

00:20:14.343 --> 00:20:16.258
HOW IS IT
THEY KNOW WHO I AM?

00:20:16.302 --> 00:20:18.129
I'M NOT SURE I'M EXACTLY
THE RIGHT PERSON

00:20:18.173 --> 00:20:20.262
TO TELL YOU THAT, HARRY.

00:20:20.306 --> 00:20:21.829
[TAPPING]

00:20:23.178 --> 00:20:25.180
[SCRAPING]

00:20:36.670 --> 00:20:39.803
WELCOME, HARRY,
TO DIAGON ALLEY.

00:20:54.340 --> 00:20:55.819
[OWL SCREECHES]

00:20:57.256 --> 00:20:59.910
Hagrid: HERE'S WHERE YOU GET
YOUR QUILLS AND YOUR INK.

00:20:59.954 --> 00:21:01.825
AND OVER THERE,
ALL YOUR BITS AND BOBS

00:21:01.869 --> 00:21:03.523
FOR DOING YOUR WIZARDRY.

00:21:19.234 --> 00:21:21.236
[SCREECH]

00:21:29.200 --> 00:21:30.811
IT'S A WORLD-CLASS
RACING BROOM.

00:21:30.854 --> 00:21:35.206
WOW, LOOK AT IT!
THE NEW NIMBUS 2000.

00:21:35.250 --> 00:21:37.948
Boy: IT'S
THE FASTEST MODEL YET.

00:21:42.213 --> 00:21:45.129
BUT, HAGRID, HOW AM I
TO PAY FOR ALL THIS?

00:21:45.173 --> 00:21:47.088
I HAVEN'T ANY MONEY.

00:21:47.131 --> 00:21:48.568
WELL, THERE'S
YOUR MONEY, HARRY.

00:21:48.611 --> 00:21:50.657
GRINGOTTS--THE WIZARD BANK.

00:21:50.700 --> 00:21:53.137
T'AIN'T NO SAFER PLACE.
NOT ONE.

00:21:53.181 --> 00:21:55.314
EXCEPT PERHAPS HOGWARTS.

00:22:07.717 --> 00:22:10.329
UH, HAGRID...

00:22:10.372 --> 00:22:12.722
WHAT EXACTLY ARE
THESE THINGS?

00:22:12.766 --> 00:22:14.724
THEY'RE GOBLINS, HARRY.

00:22:14.768 --> 00:22:16.247
CLEVER AS THEY COME,
GOBLINS,

00:22:16.291 --> 00:22:18.598
BUT NOT THE MOST
FRIENDLY OF BEASTS.

00:22:18.641 --> 00:22:20.600
BEST STAY CLOSE.

00:22:20.643 --> 00:22:24.038
[CLEARS THROAT]

00:22:24.081 --> 00:22:27.650
MR. HARRY POTTER WISHES
TO MAKE A WITHDRAWAL.

00:22:29.217 --> 00:22:31.437
OHH.

00:22:31.480 --> 00:22:35.832
AND DOES MR. HARRY POTTER
HAVE HIS KEY?

00:22:35.876 --> 00:22:38.879
OH, WAIT A MINUTE.
GOT IT HERE SOMEWHERE.

00:22:42.535 --> 00:22:45.668
HA! THERE'S
THE LITTLE DEVIL.

00:22:45.712 --> 00:22:49.498
OH, AND THERE'S
SOMETHING ELSE AS WELL.

00:22:49.542 --> 00:22:52.327
PROFESSOR DUMBLEDORE
GAVE ME THIS.

00:22:57.245 --> 00:22:59.029
IT'S ABOUT YOU-KNOW-WHAT

00:22:59.073 --> 00:23:02.468
IN VAULT YOU-KNOW-WHICH.

00:23:03.469 --> 00:23:04.731
VERY WELL.

00:23:09.736 --> 00:23:12.391
VAULT 687.

00:23:15.306 --> 00:23:17.178
LAMP, PLEASE.

00:23:26.143 --> 00:23:27.797
KEY, PLEASE.

00:23:33.107 --> 00:23:36.458
[CLICK]

00:23:36.502 --> 00:23:40.462
[RATTLING]

00:23:40.506 --> 00:23:42.551
[CREAKING]

00:23:51.081 --> 00:23:52.343
DIDN'T THINK
YOUR MUM AND DAD

00:23:52.387 --> 00:23:56.043
WOULD LEAVE YOU WITH
NOTHIN', NOW DID YOU?

00:23:56.086 --> 00:23:58.393
Griphook: VAULT 713.

00:23:58.437 --> 00:23:59.655
Harry: WHAT'S
IN THERE, HAGRID?

00:23:59.699 --> 00:24:03.050
CAN'T TELL YOU, HARRY.
HOGWARTS BUSINESS.

00:24:03.093 --> 00:24:04.399
VERY SECRET.

00:24:04.443 --> 00:24:06.140
STAND BACK.

00:24:09.709 --> 00:24:13.669
[CLICKING]

00:24:13.713 --> 00:24:15.715
[STEAM HISSES]

00:24:34.037 --> 00:24:37.258
BEST NOT TO MENTION THIS
TO ANYONE, HARRY.

00:24:45.353 --> 00:24:49.139
I STILL NEED...A WAND.

00:24:49.183 --> 00:24:50.663
A WAND?

00:24:50.706 --> 00:24:51.881
WELL, YOU WANT
OLLIVANDERS.

00:24:51.925 --> 00:24:53.361
THERE AIN'T
NO PLACE BETTER.

00:24:53.404 --> 00:24:55.929
WHY DON'T YOU RUN
ALONG THERE AND WAIT?

00:24:55.972 --> 00:24:57.931
I JUST GOT ONE MORE
THING I GOT TO DO.

00:24:57.974 --> 00:24:59.280
WON'T BE LONG.

00:25:02.936 --> 00:25:04.938
[BELL JINGLING]

00:25:16.210 --> 00:25:17.820
HELLO?

00:25:21.171 --> 00:25:22.521
HELLO?

00:25:24.087 --> 00:25:25.175
[GASPS]

00:25:26.873 --> 00:25:31.486
I WONDERED WHEN I'D BE
SEEING YOU, MR. POTTER.

00:25:38.885 --> 00:25:41.496
IT SEEMS ONLY YESTERDAY

00:25:41.540 --> 00:25:42.976
THAT YOUR
MOTHER AND FATHER

00:25:43.019 --> 00:25:46.588
WERE IN HERE BUYING
THEIR FIRST WANDS.

00:25:46.632 --> 00:25:47.850
AH.

00:25:53.813 --> 00:25:55.466
HERE WE ARE.

00:26:04.650 --> 00:26:06.565
WELL, GIVE IT A WAVE.

00:26:13.310 --> 00:26:15.574
APPARENTLY NOT.

00:26:19.839 --> 00:26:21.492
AHH.

00:26:23.756 --> 00:26:27.411
PERHAPS...

00:26:27.455 --> 00:26:28.804
THIS.

00:26:36.420 --> 00:26:41.817
NO, NO. DEFINITELY NOT.
NO MATTER.

00:26:48.607 --> 00:26:50.652
I WONDER.

00:27:11.978 --> 00:27:14.023
[WHOOSH]

00:27:19.594 --> 00:27:21.944
CURIOUS.

00:27:21.988 --> 00:27:24.251
VERY CURIOUS.

00:27:25.252 --> 00:27:28.821
S-SORRY,
BUT WHAT'S CURIOUS?

00:27:28.864 --> 00:27:33.652
I REMEMBER EVERY WAND
I'VE EVER SOLD, MR. POTTER.

00:27:33.695 --> 00:27:36.176
IT SO HAPPENS
THAT THE PHOENIX

00:27:36.219 --> 00:27:39.658
WHOSE TAIL FEATHER
RESIDES IN YOUR WAND

00:27:39.701 --> 00:27:41.660
GAVE ANOTHER FEATHER.

00:27:41.703 --> 00:27:44.880
JUST ONE OTHER.

00:27:44.924 --> 00:27:46.403
IT IS CURIOUS

00:27:46.447 --> 00:27:49.493
THAT YOU SHOULD BE
DESTINED FOR THIS WAND

00:27:49.537 --> 00:27:54.455
WHEN ITS BROTHER
GAVE YOU THAT SCAR.

00:27:56.762 --> 00:27:59.068
AND WHO OWNED THAT WAND?

00:27:59.112 --> 00:28:03.856
OH, WE DO NOT
SPEAK HIS NAME.

00:28:03.899 --> 00:28:07.729
THE WAND CHOOSES
THE WIZARD, MR. POTTER.

00:28:07.773 --> 00:28:11.037
IT'S NOT ALWAYS
CLEAR WHY,

00:28:11.080 --> 00:28:14.693
BUT I THINK IT IS CLEAR

00:28:14.736 --> 00:28:17.957
THAT WE CAN EXPECT
GREAT THINGS FROM YOU.

00:28:18.000 --> 00:28:23.571
AFTER ALL,
HE-WHO-MUST-NOT-BE-NAMED

00:28:23.614 --> 00:28:26.269
DID GREAT THINGS.

00:28:26.313 --> 00:28:30.491
TERRIBLE...YES,

00:28:30.534 --> 00:28:32.362
BUT GREAT.

00:28:36.758 --> 00:28:39.935
[RAPPING ON WINDOW]
HARRY! HARRY!

00:28:39.979 --> 00:28:41.632
HAPPY BIRTHDAY!

00:28:41.676 --> 00:28:43.765
[SCREECHES]

00:28:43.809 --> 00:28:45.332
Harry: WOW.

00:28:49.815 --> 00:28:51.164
YOU ALL RIGHT, HARRY?

00:28:51.207 --> 00:28:53.427
YOU SEEM VERY QUIET.

00:28:53.470 --> 00:28:56.517
HE KILLED MY PARENTS,
DIDN'T HE?

00:28:56.560 --> 00:28:59.128
THE ONE
WHO GAVE ME THIS.

00:28:59.172 --> 00:29:01.304
YOU KNOW, HAGRID.

00:29:01.348 --> 00:29:03.089
I KNOW YOU DO.

00:29:03.132 --> 00:29:04.873
[SIGHS]

00:29:04.917 --> 00:29:06.614
[PUSHES BOWL AWAY]

00:29:06.657 --> 00:29:08.790
FIRST--AND UNDERSTAND
THIS, HARRY,

00:29:08.834 --> 00:29:11.575
'CAUSE IT'S
VERY IMPORTANT--

00:29:11.619 --> 00:29:14.361
NOT ALL WIZARDS ARE GOOD.

00:29:14.404 --> 00:29:15.579
SOME OF THEM GO BAD.

00:29:15.623 --> 00:29:17.538
A FEW YEARS AGO,
THERE WAS ONE WIZARD

00:29:17.581 --> 00:29:19.235
WHO WENT AS BAD
AS YOU CAN GO.

00:29:19.279 --> 00:29:21.150
AND HIS NAME WAS V--

00:29:21.194 --> 00:29:22.586
[SIGHS]

00:29:22.630 --> 00:29:24.458
[SOFTLY]
HIS NAME WAS V--

00:29:24.501 --> 00:29:25.981
MAYBE IF YOU
WROTE IT DOWN?

00:29:26.025 --> 00:29:27.417
NO, I CAN'T SPELL IT.

00:29:27.461 --> 00:29:29.202
ALL RIGHT.

00:29:29.245 --> 00:29:31.204
[WHISPERING]
Voldemort.

00:29:31.247 --> 00:29:33.554
VOLDEMORT?
SHH!

00:29:36.252 --> 00:29:38.689
IT WAS DARK TIMES, HARRY.
DARK TIMES.

00:29:40.866 --> 00:29:44.434
VOLDEMORT STARTED
TO GATHER SOME FOLLOWERS,

00:29:44.478 --> 00:29:46.915
BROUGHT 'EM OVER
TO THE DARK SIDE.

00:29:49.178 --> 00:29:52.225
ANYONE THAT STOOD UP
TO HIM ENDED UP DEAD.

00:29:53.400 --> 00:29:55.315
YOUR PARENTS FOUGHT
AGAINST HIM...

00:29:56.882 --> 00:29:59.145
BUT NOBODY LIVED
ONCE HE DECIDED TO KILL 'EM.

00:29:59.188 --> 00:30:01.060
[SCREAMING]

00:30:04.628 --> 00:30:07.283
NOBODY, NOT ONE.

00:30:07.327 --> 00:30:09.416
EXCEPT YOU.

00:30:11.940 --> 00:30:13.246
[WHISPERING]
Me?

00:30:13.289 --> 00:30:16.249
Voldemort tried
to kill...me?

00:30:16.292 --> 00:30:17.772
YES.

00:30:17.816 --> 00:30:20.470
THAT AIN'T NO ORDINARY CUT
ON YOUR FOREHEAD, HARRY.

00:30:20.514 --> 00:30:22.690
A MARK LIKE THAT
ONLY COMES

00:30:22.733 --> 00:30:24.474
FROM BEING TOUCHED
BY A CURSE

00:30:24.518 --> 00:30:26.041
AND AN EVIL CURSE AT THAT.

00:30:27.129 --> 00:30:30.698
WHAT HAPPENED TO VO--
TO YOU-KNOW-WHO?

00:30:30.741 --> 00:30:34.702
WELL, SOME SAY HE DIED.

00:30:34.745 --> 00:30:37.705
CODSWALLOP, IN MY OPINION.

00:30:37.748 --> 00:30:41.535
NOPE, I RECKON
HE'S OUT THERE STILL...

00:30:41.578 --> 00:30:44.625
TOO TIRED TO CARRY ON.

00:30:44.668 --> 00:30:46.845
BUT ONE THING'S
ABSOLUTELY CERTAIN.

00:30:46.888 --> 00:30:49.412
SOMETHING ABOUT YOU
STUMPED HIM THAT NIGHT.

00:30:49.456 --> 00:30:51.850
THAT'S WHY YOU'RE FAMOUS.

00:30:51.893 --> 00:30:54.635
THAT'S WHY EVERYBODY
KNOWS YOUR NAME.

00:30:54.678 --> 00:30:57.464
YOU'RE THE BOY WHO LIVED.

00:31:04.471 --> 00:31:06.473
[INDISTINCT P.A. ANNOUNCEMENT]

00:31:08.170 --> 00:31:09.824
WHAT'RE YOU LOOKIN' AT?

00:31:12.740 --> 00:31:14.263
BLIMEY!
IS THAT THE TIME?

00:31:14.307 --> 00:31:16.309
SORRY, HARRY, I'M GONNA
HAVE TO LEAVE YOU.

00:31:16.352 --> 00:31:18.833
DUMBLEDORE'LL BE
WANTIN' HIS, UH...

00:31:18.877 --> 00:31:20.661
WELL, HE'LL BE
WANTIN' TO SEE ME.

00:31:20.704 --> 00:31:23.838
NOW, UH, YOUR TRAIN
LEAVES IN 10 MINUTES.

00:31:23.882 --> 00:31:25.840
HERE'S YOUR TICKET.
STICK TO IT, HARRY.

00:31:25.884 --> 00:31:27.886
THAT'S VERY IMPORTANT.
STICK TO YOUR TICKET.

00:31:32.194 --> 00:31:34.762
"PLATFORM 9 3/4"?

00:31:34.805 --> 00:31:37.330
BUT, HAGRID, THERE
MUST BE A MISTAKE.

00:31:37.373 --> 00:31:39.636
THIS SAYS PLATFORM 9 3/4.

00:31:39.680 --> 00:31:42.030
THERE'S NO SUCH THING...
IS THERE?

00:31:49.603 --> 00:31:51.344
[BELL CHIMES]

00:31:55.261 --> 00:31:57.263
[INDISTINCT P.A. ANNOUNCEMENT]

00:32:01.441 --> 00:32:02.485
SORRY.

00:32:04.792 --> 00:32:07.751
EXCUSE ME.
EXCUSE ME.

00:32:07.795 --> 00:32:09.405
RIGHT ON YOUR LEFT,
MADAM.

00:32:09.449 --> 00:32:10.537
EXCUSE ME, SIR.

00:32:10.580 --> 00:32:11.799
CAN YOU TELL ME
WHERE I MIGHT FIND

00:32:11.842 --> 00:32:13.192
PLATFORM 9 3/4?

00:32:13.235 --> 00:32:14.758
9 3/4?

00:32:14.802 --> 00:32:15.977
THINK YOU'RE BEIN'
FUNNY, DO YOU?

00:32:16.021 --> 00:32:17.239
Mrs. Weasley:
IT'S THE SAME EVERY YEAR.

00:32:17.283 --> 00:32:19.502
PACKED WITH MUGGLES,
OF COURSE. COME ON.

00:32:19.546 --> 00:32:20.721
MUGGLES?

00:32:20.764 --> 00:32:21.983
Mrs. Weasley:
PLATFORM 9 3/4 THIS WAY.

00:32:28.903 --> 00:32:31.514
ALL RIGHT, PERCY.
YOU FIRST.

00:32:42.134 --> 00:32:43.439
FRED, YOU NEXT.

00:32:43.483 --> 00:32:45.093
HE'S NOT FRED, I AM!

00:32:45.137 --> 00:32:46.181
HONESTLY, WOMAN.

00:32:46.225 --> 00:32:47.835
YOU CALL YOURSELF
OUR MOTHER.

00:32:47.878 --> 00:32:49.445
OH, I'M SORRY, GEORGE.

00:32:53.623 --> 00:32:56.061
I'M ONLY JOKING.
I AM FRED.

00:33:01.718 --> 00:33:03.068
EXCUSE ME!

00:33:05.505 --> 00:33:08.464
C-COULD YOU
TELL ME HOW TO--

00:33:08.508 --> 00:33:10.684
HOW TO GET
ONTO THE PLATFORM?

00:33:10.727 --> 00:33:12.077
YES, NOT TO WORRY, DEAR.

00:33:12.120 --> 00:33:14.905
IT'S RON'S FIRST TIME
TO HOGWARTS AS WELL.

00:33:14.949 --> 00:33:16.472
NOW, ALL YOU'VE
GOT TO DO

00:33:16.516 --> 00:33:18.997
IS WALK STRAIGHT
AT THE WALL

00:33:19.040 --> 00:33:20.955
BETWEEN PLATFORMS 9 AND 10.

00:33:20.999 --> 00:33:22.870
BEST DO IT AT A BIT
OF A RUN IF YOU'RE NERVOUS.

00:33:22.913 --> 00:33:24.524
GOOD LUCK.

00:33:56.686 --> 00:33:59.559
[TRAIN WHISTLE BLOWS]

00:34:21.842 --> 00:34:24.453
Ron: EXCUSE ME.
DO YOU MIND?

00:34:24.497 --> 00:34:26.368
EVERYWHERE ELSE IS FULL.

00:34:26.412 --> 00:34:27.761
NOT AT ALL.

00:34:31.721 --> 00:34:34.333
I'M RON, BY THE WAY.
RON WEASLEY.

00:34:34.376 --> 00:34:36.074
I'M HARRY.
HARRY POTTER.

00:34:38.598 --> 00:34:40.600
SO--SO IT'S TRUE.

00:34:40.643 --> 00:34:44.212
I MEAN, DO YOU REALLY
HAVE THE--THE--

00:34:44.256 --> 00:34:45.213
THE WHAT?

00:34:45.257 --> 00:34:47.085
[WHISPERING]
The scar.

00:34:47.128 --> 00:34:49.609
OH. YEAH.

00:34:49.652 --> 00:34:51.045
WICKED!

00:34:54.483 --> 00:34:56.398
ANYTHING OFF THE
TROLLEY, DEARS?

00:34:56.442 --> 00:34:57.791
NO, THANKS.

00:34:57.834 --> 00:35:00.098
I'M ALL SET.

00:35:03.927 --> 00:35:05.799
WE'LL TAKE THE LOT.

00:35:08.193 --> 00:35:10.499
WHOA.

00:35:16.375 --> 00:35:17.550
[SQUEAKING]

00:35:17.593 --> 00:35:19.073
BERTIE BOTT'S
EVERY FLAVOR BEANS?

00:35:19.117 --> 00:35:21.423
THEY MEAN
EVERY FLAVOR.

00:35:21.467 --> 00:35:24.078
THERE'S CHOCOLATE
AND PEPPERMINT,

00:35:24.122 --> 00:35:29.866
AND THERE'S ALSO SPINACH,
LIVER, AND TRIPE.

00:35:29.910 --> 00:35:33.043
GEORGE SWEARS HE GOT
A BOGIE-FLAVORED ONE ONCE.

00:35:38.223 --> 00:35:40.225
Harry: THESE AREN'T
REAL FROGS, ARE THEY?

00:35:40.268 --> 00:35:41.835
IT'S JUST A SPELL.

00:35:41.878 --> 00:35:44.011
BESIDES, IT'S
THE CARDS YOU WANT.

00:35:44.054 --> 00:35:46.318
EACH PACK'S GOT
A FAMOUS WITCH OR WIZARD.

00:35:46.361 --> 00:35:49.016
I'VE GOT
ABOUT 500 MESELF.

00:35:49.059 --> 00:35:50.539
[RIBBIT]

00:35:50.583 --> 00:35:52.150
[RIBBIT]
WATCH IT.

00:35:53.194 --> 00:35:54.369
[RIBBIT]

00:35:55.414 --> 00:35:57.067
OH, THAT'S ROTTEN LUCK.

00:35:57.111 --> 00:35:58.939
THEY'VE ONLY GOT
ONE GOOD JUMP IN THEM

00:35:58.982 --> 00:36:00.897
TO BEGIN WITH.

00:36:01.898 --> 00:36:03.465
Harry:
I'VE GOT DUMBLEDORE!

00:36:03.509 --> 00:36:06.164
I GOT ABOUT 6 OF HIM.

00:36:07.861 --> 00:36:09.515
HEY, HE'S GONE.

00:36:09.558 --> 00:36:10.603
WELL, YOU CAN'T EXPECT HIM

00:36:10.646 --> 00:36:13.171
TO HANG AROUND
ALL DAY, CAN YOU?

00:36:13.214 --> 00:36:14.215
[SQUEAKING]

00:36:14.259 --> 00:36:15.390
THIS IS SCABBERS,
BY THE WAY.

00:36:15.434 --> 00:36:16.957
PATHETIC, ISN'T HE?

00:36:17.000 --> 00:36:18.306
JUST A LITTLE BIT.

00:36:18.350 --> 00:36:20.700
FRED GAVE ME A SPELL
THAT'S TO TURN HIM YELLOW.

00:36:20.743 --> 00:36:21.918
WANT TO SEE?

00:36:21.962 --> 00:36:23.137
YEAH.

00:36:26.271 --> 00:36:28.186
AHEM.

00:36:28.229 --> 00:36:30.536
SUN--

00:36:30.579 --> 00:36:32.581
HAS ANYONE SEEN
A TOAD?

00:36:32.625 --> 00:36:34.496
A BOY NAMED NEVILLE'S
LOST ONE.

00:36:34.540 --> 00:36:35.497
NO.

00:36:35.541 --> 00:36:38.108
OH, ARE YOU DOING MAGIC?

00:36:38.152 --> 00:36:39.371
LET'S SEE, THEN.

00:36:39.414 --> 00:36:40.981
AHEM.

00:36:41.024 --> 00:36:45.812
SUNSHINE, DAISIES,
BUTTER MELLOW,

00:36:45.855 --> 00:36:48.075
TURN THIS STUPID,
FAT RAT YELLOW.

00:36:48.118 --> 00:36:49.468
[SQUEAKS]

00:36:52.079 --> 00:36:54.560
ARE YOU SURE
THAT'S A REAL SPELL?

00:36:54.603 --> 00:36:56.910
WELL, IT'S NOT
VERY GOOD, IS IT?

00:36:56.953 --> 00:36:59.217
OF COURSE,
I'VE ONLY TRIED

00:36:59.260 --> 00:37:00.957
A FEW SIMPLE ONES MYSELF,

00:37:01.001 --> 00:37:03.090
BUT THEY'VE ALL
WORKED FOR ME.

00:37:06.746 --> 00:37:08.487
FOR EXAMPLE.

00:37:09.792 --> 00:37:11.620
OCULUS REPARO.

00:37:14.797 --> 00:37:16.451
THAT'S BETTER,
ISN'T IT?

00:37:17.757 --> 00:37:20.281
[GASPS]
HOLY CRICKET!

00:37:20.325 --> 00:37:22.588
YOU'RE HARRY POTTER!

00:37:22.631 --> 00:37:24.329
I'M HERMIONE GRANGER.

00:37:24.372 --> 00:37:26.374
AND YOU ARE...

00:37:26.418 --> 00:37:29.029
I'M RON WEASLEY.

00:37:29.072 --> 00:37:30.378
PLEASURE.

00:37:30.422 --> 00:37:32.554
YOU TWO BETTER CHANGE
INTO YOUR ROBES.

00:37:32.598 --> 00:37:34.817
I EXPECT WE'LL BE
ARRIVING SOON.

00:37:39.300 --> 00:37:41.998
YOU'VE GOT DIRT
ON YOUR NOSE, BY THE WAY.

00:37:42.042 --> 00:37:44.044
DID YOU KNOW?
JUST THERE.

00:37:44.087 --> 00:37:45.393
[TRAIN WHISTLE BLOWS]

00:37:57.318 --> 00:38:00.974
RIGHT, THEN! FIRST YEARS,
THIS WAY, PLEASE!

00:38:01.017 --> 00:38:02.323
COME ON NOW!

00:38:02.367 --> 00:38:03.585
FIRST YEARS, DON'T BE SHY!

00:38:03.629 --> 00:38:06.893
COME ON NOW.
HURRY UP. COME ON!

00:38:13.769 --> 00:38:14.770
HELLO, HARRY.

00:38:14.814 --> 00:38:16.294
HEY, HAGRID.

00:38:16.337 --> 00:38:17.599
WHOA!

00:38:17.643 --> 00:38:19.601
RIGHT, THEN.
THIS WAY TO THE BOATS.

00:38:19.645 --> 00:38:21.560
COME ON NOW. FOLLOW ME.

00:39:07.432 --> 00:39:09.216
WICKED.

00:39:37.897 --> 00:39:40.160
WELCOME TO HOGWARTS.

00:39:40.203 --> 00:39:41.857
NOW, IN A FEW MOMENTS,

00:39:41.901 --> 00:39:43.337
YOU WILL PASS
THROUGH THESE DOORS

00:39:43.381 --> 00:39:44.512
AND JOIN YOUR CLASSMATES,

00:39:44.556 --> 00:39:46.384
BUT BEFORE YOU CAN
TAKE YOUR SEATS,

00:39:46.427 --> 00:39:49.822
YOU MUST BE SORTED
INTO YOUR HOUSES.

00:39:49.865 --> 00:39:52.868
THEY ARE GRYFFINDOR,
HUFFLEPUFF,

00:39:52.912 --> 00:39:57.612
RAVENCLAW,
AND SLYTHERIN.

00:39:57.656 --> 00:39:59.658
NOW, WHILE YOU'RE HERE,

00:39:59.701 --> 00:40:03.270
YOUR HOUSE WILL BE
LIKE YOUR FAMILY.

00:40:03.313 --> 00:40:07.405
YOUR TRIUMPHS WILL
EARN YOU POINTS.

00:40:07.448 --> 00:40:11.583
ANY RULE-BREAKING,
AND YOU WILL LOSE POINTS.

00:40:11.626 --> 00:40:14.107
AT THE END OF THE YEAR,

00:40:14.150 --> 00:40:15.891
THE HOUSE
WITH THE MOST POINTS

00:40:15.935 --> 00:40:17.240
IS AWARDED THE HOUSE CUP.

00:40:17.284 --> 00:40:18.720
TREVOR!

00:40:18.764 --> 00:40:21.375
[LAUGHTER]

00:40:21.419 --> 00:40:22.811
[CROAKING]

00:40:27.207 --> 00:40:29.296
SORRY.

00:40:29.339 --> 00:40:32.560
THE SORTING CEREMONY
WILL BEGIN MOMENTARILY.

00:40:33.909 --> 00:40:35.520
IT'S TRUE, THEN.

00:40:35.563 --> 00:40:38.044
WHAT THEY'RE SAYING
ON THE TRAIN.

00:40:38.087 --> 00:40:40.307
HARRY POTTER HAS
COME TO HOGWARTS.

00:40:40.350 --> 00:40:41.351
[STUDENTS GASP]

00:40:41.395 --> 00:40:42.614
[WHISPERING]
Harry Potter?

00:40:42.657 --> 00:40:46.139
THIS IS CRABBE
AND GOYLE...

00:40:46.182 --> 00:40:48.489
AND I'M MALFOY.

00:40:48.533 --> 00:40:50.143
DRACO MALFOY.

00:40:50.186 --> 00:40:51.884
[SNICKERS]

00:40:53.015 --> 00:40:54.495
THINK MY NAME'S
FUNNY, DO YOU?

00:40:54.539 --> 00:40:56.715
NO NEED
TO ASK YOU YOURS.

00:40:56.758 --> 00:40:59.718
RED HAIR AND
A HAND-ME-DOWN ROBE?

00:40:59.761 --> 00:41:01.981
YOU MUST BE
A WEASLEY.

00:41:03.069 --> 00:41:04.505
YOU'LL SOON FIND OUT

00:41:04.549 --> 00:41:05.811
THAT SOME
WIZARDING FAMILIES

00:41:05.854 --> 00:41:07.290
ARE BETTER THAN
OTHERS, POTTER.

00:41:07.334 --> 00:41:09.205
YOU DON'T WANT
TO GO MAKING FRIENDS

00:41:09.249 --> 00:41:11.164
WITH THE WRONG SORT.

00:41:11.207 --> 00:41:13.514
I CAN HELP YOU
THERE.

00:41:15.951 --> 00:41:17.692
I THINK I CAN TELL
THE WRONG SORT

00:41:17.736 --> 00:41:19.085
FOR MYSELF, THANKS.

00:41:25.874 --> 00:41:26.875
WE'RE READY
FOR YOU NOW.

00:41:26.919 --> 00:41:27.920
FOLLOW ME.

00:41:46.112 --> 00:41:47.548
IT'S NOT REAL,
THE CEILING.

00:41:47.592 --> 00:41:48.941
IT'S JUST BEWITCHED

00:41:48.984 --> 00:41:50.986
TO LOOK LIKE
THE NIGHT SKY.

00:41:51.030 --> 00:41:54.250
I READ ABOUT IT IN
HOGWARTS: A HISTORY.

00:42:07.089 --> 00:42:08.874
ALL RIGHT. WILL YOU WAIT
ALONG HERE, PLEASE?

00:42:11.180 --> 00:42:14.575
NOW, BEFORE WE BEGIN,

00:42:14.619 --> 00:42:16.272
PROFESSOR DUMBLEDORE

00:42:16.316 --> 00:42:18.013
WOULD LIKE
TO SAY A FEW WORDS.

00:42:18.057 --> 00:42:20.538
I HAVE A FEW
START-OF-TERM NOTICES

00:42:20.581 --> 00:42:23.323
I WISH TO ANNOUNCE.

00:42:23.366 --> 00:42:25.455
THE FIRST YEARS,
PLEASE NOTE

00:42:25.499 --> 00:42:29.198
THAT THE DARK FOREST
IS STRICTLY FORBIDDEN

00:42:29.242 --> 00:42:31.418
TO ALL STUDENTS.

00:42:31.461 --> 00:42:34.769
ALSO, OUR CARETAKER,
MR. FILCH,

00:42:34.813 --> 00:42:37.337
HAS ASKED ME
TO REMIND YOU

00:42:37.380 --> 00:42:39.165
THAT THE THIRD-FLOOR
CORRIDOR

00:42:39.208 --> 00:42:42.472
ON THE RIGHT-HAND SIDE
IS OUT OF BOUNDS

00:42:42.516 --> 00:42:44.300
TO EVERYONE
WHO DOES NOT WISH

00:42:44.344 --> 00:42:46.955
TO DIE A MOST
PAINFUL DEATH.

00:42:46.999 --> 00:42:49.523
THANK YOU.

00:42:50.698 --> 00:42:53.614
WHEN I CALL YOUR NAME,

00:42:53.658 --> 00:42:57.052
YOU WILL COME FORTH,
I SHALL PLACE

00:42:57.096 --> 00:42:59.838
THE SORTING HAT
ON YOUR HEAD...

00:42:59.881 --> 00:43:03.058
AND YOU WILL BE SORTED
INTO YOUR HOUSES.

00:43:03.102 --> 00:43:05.017
HERMIONE GRANGER.

00:43:05.060 --> 00:43:06.235
[SIGHS]

00:43:08.281 --> 00:43:09.630
OH, NO.

00:43:09.674 --> 00:43:11.066
OK, RELAX.

00:43:11.110 --> 00:43:14.200
MENTAL, THAT ONE.
I'M TELLIN' YOU.

00:43:18.900 --> 00:43:21.729
AH, RIGHT, THEN.

00:43:21.773 --> 00:43:24.123
HMM. RIGHT.

00:43:24.166 --> 00:43:27.517
OK...GRYFFINDOR!

00:43:27.561 --> 00:43:29.781
[CHEERING]

00:43:36.396 --> 00:43:38.398
DRACO MALFOY.

00:43:43.795 --> 00:43:45.013
SLYTHERIN!

00:43:45.057 --> 00:43:46.885
[CHEERING]

00:43:46.928 --> 00:43:48.147
THERE'S NOT A WITCH

00:43:48.190 --> 00:43:49.148
OR WIZARD
WHO WENT BAD

00:43:49.191 --> 00:43:50.236
WHO WASN'T
IN SLYTHERIN.

00:43:50.279 --> 00:43:51.629
SUSAN BONES.

00:43:59.724 --> 00:44:01.464
AHH!

00:44:01.508 --> 00:44:02.988
HARRY!
WHAT IS IT?

00:44:03.031 --> 00:44:05.120
NOTHING.

00:44:05.164 --> 00:44:06.687
NOTHING.
I'M FINE.

00:44:06.731 --> 00:44:08.428
Sorting Hat:
LET'S SEE.

00:44:08.471 --> 00:44:11.649
I KNOW...
HUFFLEPUFF!

00:44:11.692 --> 00:44:14.477
[CHEERING]

00:44:14.521 --> 00:44:16.523
Professor McGonagall:
RONALD WEASLEY.

00:44:29.884 --> 00:44:33.018
HA! ANOTHER WEASLEY.

00:44:33.061 --> 00:44:35.977
I KNOW JUST WHAT
TO DO WITH YOU.

00:44:36.021 --> 00:44:37.936
GRYFFINDOR!

00:44:37.979 --> 00:44:41.200
[CHEERING]

00:44:44.943 --> 00:44:46.901
HARRY POTTER.

00:45:04.484 --> 00:45:05.528
HMM.

00:45:05.572 --> 00:45:08.749
DIFFICULT,
VERY DIFFICULT.

00:45:08.793 --> 00:45:10.969
PLENTY OF COURAGE,
I SEE.

00:45:11.012 --> 00:45:13.014
NOT A BAD MIND,
EITHER.

00:45:13.058 --> 00:45:15.408
THERE'S TALENT--
OH, YES--

00:45:15.451 --> 00:45:18.803
AND A THIRST
TO PROVE YOURSELF.

00:45:18.846 --> 00:45:21.762
BUT WHERE TO PUT YOU?

00:45:21.806 --> 00:45:23.764
[WHISPERING]
Not Slytherin.

00:45:23.808 --> 00:45:24.896
Not Slytherin.

00:45:24.939 --> 00:45:27.115
NOT SLYTHERIN, EH?

00:45:27.159 --> 00:45:28.769
ARE YOU SURE?

00:45:28.813 --> 00:45:30.423
YOU COULD BE GREAT,
YOU KNOW.

00:45:30.466 --> 00:45:33.905
IT'S ALL HERE
IN YOUR HEAD.

00:45:33.948 --> 00:45:35.776
AND SLYTHERIN
WILL HELP YOU

00:45:35.820 --> 00:45:37.735
ON THE WAY
TO GREATNESS,

00:45:37.778 --> 00:45:39.649
THERE'S NO DOUBT
ABOUT THAT.

00:45:39.693 --> 00:45:40.694
NO?

00:45:40.738 --> 00:45:41.695
No, please,
please...

00:45:41.739 --> 00:45:43.828
WELL, IF YOU'RE SURE...

00:45:43.871 --> 00:45:44.829
...anything
but Slytherin...

00:45:44.872 --> 00:45:48.441
BETTER BE...GRYFFINDOR!

00:45:48.484 --> 00:45:50.486
[CHEERING]

00:46:12.682 --> 00:46:13.901
[DINGING]

00:46:13.945 --> 00:46:15.598
YOUR ATTENTION,
PLEASE.

00:46:18.732 --> 00:46:21.474
LET THE FEAST BEGIN.

00:46:22.605 --> 00:46:24.738
[STUDENTS CHATTERING]

00:46:26.218 --> 00:46:27.393
WOW.

00:46:37.969 --> 00:46:39.666
I'M HALF AND HALF.

00:46:39.709 --> 00:46:41.537
ME DAD'S A MUGGLE.

00:46:41.581 --> 00:46:42.843
MUM'S A WITCH.

00:46:42.887 --> 00:46:44.845
BIT OF A NASTY SHOCK
FOR HIM

00:46:44.889 --> 00:46:46.064
WHEN HE FOUND OUT.

00:46:47.761 --> 00:46:50.720
SAY, PERCY,
WHO'S THAT TEACHER

00:46:50.764 --> 00:46:51.852
TALKING TO
PROFESSOR QUIRRELL?

00:46:51.896 --> 00:46:53.549
Percy: OH, THAT'S
PROFESSOR SNAPE,

00:46:53.593 --> 00:46:55.377
HEAD
OF SLYTHERIN HOUSE.

00:46:55.421 --> 00:46:56.422
WHAT'S HE TEACH?

00:46:56.465 --> 00:46:57.423
POTIONS.

00:46:57.466 --> 00:46:58.467
BUT EVERYONE KNOWS

00:46:58.511 --> 00:46:59.686
IT'S THE DARK ARTS
HE FANCIES.

00:46:59.729 --> 00:47:00.861
HE'S BEEN AFTER
QUIRRELL'S JOB

00:47:00.905 --> 00:47:02.123
FOR YEARS.

00:47:07.259 --> 00:47:09.217
AAH!
HELLO!

00:47:09.261 --> 00:47:10.218
HOW ARE YOU?

00:47:10.262 --> 00:47:12.568
WELCOME
TO GRYFFINDOR.

00:47:12.612 --> 00:47:14.744
[WIND BLOWING]

00:47:16.659 --> 00:47:18.183
[LAUGHTER]

00:47:19.271 --> 00:47:21.926
WHOO-HOO-HOO!
WHOO-HOO!

00:47:23.884 --> 00:47:25.233
Girl: LOOK, IT'S
THE BLOODY BARON!

00:47:25.277 --> 00:47:27.235
[LAUGHING]

00:47:30.978 --> 00:47:33.154
HELLO, SIR NICHOLAS.
HAVE A NICE SUMMER?

00:47:33.198 --> 00:47:34.895
DISMAL.

00:47:34.939 --> 00:47:36.418
ONCE AGAIN,
MY REQUEST TO JOIN

00:47:36.462 --> 00:47:39.508
THE HEADLESS HUNT
HAS BEEN DENIED.

00:47:42.076 --> 00:47:43.643
I KNOW YOU!

00:47:43.686 --> 00:47:45.514
YOU'RE NEARLY HEADLESS NICK!

00:47:45.558 --> 00:47:48.474
I PREFER SIR NICHOLAS,
IF YOU DON'T MIND.

00:47:48.517 --> 00:47:50.128
NEARLY HEADLESS?

00:47:50.171 --> 00:47:52.130
HOW CAN YOU BE
NEARLY HEADLESS?

00:47:52.173 --> 00:47:53.522
LIKE THIS.

00:47:55.176 --> 00:47:56.438
AAH!

00:48:04.229 --> 00:48:05.926
Percy: GRYFFINDORS,
FOLLOW ME, PLEASE.

00:48:05.970 --> 00:48:07.667
KEEP UP. THANK YOU.

00:48:07.710 --> 00:48:10.148
RAVENCLAW,
FOLLOW ME.

00:48:10.191 --> 00:48:12.367
THIS WAY.

00:48:12.411 --> 00:48:14.587
THIS IS
THE MOST DIRECT PATH

00:48:14.630 --> 00:48:15.805
TO THE DORMITORIES.

00:48:15.849 --> 00:48:17.851
OH, AND KEEP AN EYE
ON THE STAIRCASES.

00:48:17.895 --> 00:48:19.766
THEY LIKE TO CHANGE.

00:48:29.254 --> 00:48:32.474
KEEP UP, PLEASE,
AND FOLLOW ME.

00:48:32.518 --> 00:48:33.954
QUICKLY, NOW.
COME ON.

00:48:33.998 --> 00:48:35.695
COME ON.

00:48:35.738 --> 00:48:38.089
Neville: SEAMUS,
THAT PICTURE'S MOVING!

00:48:38.132 --> 00:48:39.786
Ron: LOOK AT
THAT ONE, HARRY.

00:48:39.829 --> 00:48:41.396
Harry: I THINK
SHE FANCIES YOU.

00:48:41.440 --> 00:48:44.051
[STUDENTS CHATTERING]

00:48:44.095 --> 00:48:46.271
Girl: OH, LOOK! LOOK!
WHO'S THAT GIRL?

00:48:46.314 --> 00:48:49.013
Man in painting:
WELCOME TO HOGWARTS.

00:48:50.579 --> 00:48:51.885
WHO'S THAT?

00:49:04.550 --> 00:49:06.726
PASSWORD?

00:49:06.769 --> 00:49:09.163
CAPUT DRACONIS.

00:49:11.644 --> 00:49:12.906
WOW!

00:49:16.431 --> 00:49:18.433
Percy:
FOLLOW ME, EVERYONE.

00:49:18.477 --> 00:49:20.522
KEEP UP.
QUICKLY, COME ON.

00:49:22.437 --> 00:49:24.091
Girl: OH, WOW!

00:49:24.135 --> 00:49:25.745
Percy:
GATHER 'ROUND HERE.

00:49:28.052 --> 00:49:31.577
WELCOME TO THE
GRYFFINDOR COMMON ROOM.

00:49:31.620 --> 00:49:34.406
BOYS' DORMITORIES, UPSTAIRS
AND DOWN TO YOUR LEFT,

00:49:34.449 --> 00:49:36.234
GIRLS', THE SAME
ON YOUR RIGHT.

00:49:36.277 --> 00:49:37.800
YOU'LL FIND
ALL YOUR BELONGINGS

00:49:37.844 --> 00:49:39.628
HAVE ALREADY BEEN
BROUGHT UP.

00:50:46.826 --> 00:50:49.263
WHEW. MADE IT.

00:50:49.307 --> 00:50:50.569
CAN YOU IMAGINE
THE LOOK

00:50:50.612 --> 00:50:52.745
ON OLD McGONAGALL'S FACE
IF WE WERE LATE?

00:50:57.228 --> 00:50:59.099
THAT WAS
BLOODY BRILLIANT.

00:50:59.143 --> 00:51:02.233
OH, THANK YOU FOR THAT
ASSESSMENT, MR. WEASLEY.

00:51:02.276 --> 00:51:03.756
PERHAPS IT WOULD BE
MORE USEFUL

00:51:03.799 --> 00:51:05.671
IF I WERE TO TRANSFIGURE
MR. POTTER AND YOURSELF

00:51:05.714 --> 00:51:06.889
INTO A POCKET WATCH?

00:51:06.933 --> 00:51:08.674
THAT WAY, ONE OF YOU
MIGHT BE ON TIME.

00:51:08.717 --> 00:51:10.589
WE GOT LOST.

00:51:10.632 --> 00:51:12.591
THEN PERHAPS A MAP?

00:51:12.634 --> 00:51:14.984
I TRUST YOU DON'T NEED ONE
TO FIND YOUR SEATS?

00:51:19.598 --> 00:51:21.600
[STUDENTS TALKING SOFTLY]

00:51:24.342 --> 00:51:26.039
THERE WILL BE
NO FOOLISH WAND-WAVING

00:51:26.083 --> 00:51:30.087
OR SILLY INCANTATIONS
IN THIS CLASS.

00:51:30.130 --> 00:51:33.438
AS SUCH, I DON'T
EXPECT MANY OF YOU

00:51:33.481 --> 00:51:35.092
TO APPRECIATE
THE SUBTLE SCIENCE

00:51:35.135 --> 00:51:37.442
AND EXACT ART
THAT IS POTION MAKING.

00:51:37.485 --> 00:51:42.142
HOWEVER, FOR THOSE
SELECT FEW...

00:51:42.186 --> 00:51:45.493
WHO POSSESS
THE PREDISPOSITION...

00:51:48.844 --> 00:51:52.674
I CAN TEACH YOU HOW
TO BEWITCH THE MIND

00:51:52.718 --> 00:51:55.460
AND ENSNARE THE SENSES.

00:51:55.503 --> 00:51:58.332
I CAN TELL YOU
HOW TO BOTTLE FAME,

00:51:58.376 --> 00:51:59.768
BREW GLORY,

00:51:59.812 --> 00:52:03.816
AND EVEN PUT
A STOPPER IN DEATH.

00:52:08.690 --> 00:52:12.172
THEN AGAIN,
MAYBE SOME OF YOU

00:52:12.216 --> 00:52:13.391
HAVE COME TO HOGWARTS

00:52:13.434 --> 00:52:16.045
IN POSSESSION OF
ABILITIES SO FORMIDABLE

00:52:16.089 --> 00:52:18.570
THAT YOU FEEL
CONFIDENT ENOUGH

00:52:18.613 --> 00:52:21.877
TO NOT PAY ATTENTION.

00:52:28.536 --> 00:52:30.408
MR. POTTER.

00:52:32.192 --> 00:52:36.370
OUR NEW CELEBRITY.

00:52:38.111 --> 00:52:39.852
TELL ME,
WHAT WOULD I GET

00:52:39.895 --> 00:52:41.419
IF ADDED POWDERED
ROOT OF ASPHODEL

00:52:41.462 --> 00:52:43.029
TO AN INFUSION
OF WORMWOOD?

00:52:43.072 --> 00:52:44.204
[GASPS]

00:52:47.381 --> 00:52:48.600
YOU DON'T KNOW?

00:52:48.643 --> 00:52:50.384
WELL, LET'S TRY AGAIN.

00:52:50.428 --> 00:52:51.559
WHERE, MR. POTTER,
WOULD YOU LOOK

00:52:51.603 --> 00:52:53.344
IF I ASKED YOU
TO FIND ME A BEZOAR?

00:52:55.911 --> 00:52:57.522
I DON'T KNOW, SIR.

00:52:57.565 --> 00:52:58.914
AND WHAT IS
THE DIFFERENCE

00:52:58.958 --> 00:53:00.481
BETWEEN MONKSHOOD
AND WOLFBANE?

00:53:00.525 --> 00:53:02.353
OH!

00:53:03.745 --> 00:53:05.530
I DON'T KNOW, SIR.

00:53:07.140 --> 00:53:08.750
PITY.

00:53:10.535 --> 00:53:15.322
CLEARLY, FAME
ISN'T EVERYTHING...

00:53:15.366 --> 00:53:17.281
IS IT, MR. POTTER?

00:53:20.284 --> 00:53:22.460
EYE OF RABBIT,
HARP STRING HUM.

00:53:22.503 --> 00:53:25.158
TURN THIS WATER
INTO RUM.

00:53:27.160 --> 00:53:29.380
EYE OF RABBIT,
HARP STRING HUM...

00:53:29.423 --> 00:53:30.555
WHAT'S SEAMUS
TRYING TO DO

00:53:30.598 --> 00:53:31.686
TO THAT GLASS
OF WATER?

00:53:31.730 --> 00:53:34.123
TURN IT TO RUM.
ACTUALLY MANAGED

00:53:34.167 --> 00:53:36.474
A WEAK TEA
YESTERDAY, BEFORE...

00:53:36.517 --> 00:53:38.302
[BOOM]

00:53:38.345 --> 00:53:40.347
[LAUGHTER]

00:53:41.392 --> 00:53:42.480
[OWL SCREECHES]

00:53:42.523 --> 00:53:44.786
AH! MAIL'S HERE!

00:53:52.403 --> 00:53:54.492
[OWLS SCREECHING]

00:54:17.689 --> 00:54:19.473
CAN I BORROW THIS?

00:54:19.517 --> 00:54:20.648
THANKS.

00:54:24.478 --> 00:54:25.436
HEY, LOOK!

00:54:25.479 --> 00:54:26.872
NEVILLE'S GOT
A REMEMBRALL.

00:54:26.915 --> 00:54:28.439
I'VE READ ABOUT THOSE.

00:54:28.482 --> 00:54:30.049
WHEN THE SMOKE TURNS RED,

00:54:30.092 --> 00:54:32.486
IT MEANS YOU'VE
FORGOTTEN SOMETHING.

00:54:32.530 --> 00:54:34.053
THE ONLY PROBLEM IS,

00:54:34.096 --> 00:54:36.185
I CAN'T REMEMBER
WHAT I'VE FORGOTTEN.

00:54:36.229 --> 00:54:37.709
HEY, RON.

00:54:37.752 --> 00:54:39.667
SOMEBODY BROKE
INTO GRINGOTTS.

00:54:39.711 --> 00:54:41.147
LISTEN.

00:54:41.190 --> 00:54:42.453
"BELIEVED TO BE THE WORK

00:54:42.496 --> 00:54:44.455
"OF DARK WIZARDS
OR WITCHES UNKNOWN.

00:54:44.498 --> 00:54:45.760
"GRINGOTTS GOBLINS,

00:54:45.804 --> 00:54:47.284
"WHILE ACKNOWLEDGING
THE BREACH,

00:54:47.327 --> 00:54:49.242
"INSIST NOTHING WAS TAKEN.

00:54:49.286 --> 00:54:51.679
"THE VAULT IN QUESTION,
NUMBER 713,

00:54:51.723 --> 00:54:55.117
HAD, IN FACT, BEEN EMPTIED
EARLIER THAT VERY SAME DAY."

00:54:55.161 --> 00:54:56.945
THAT'S ODD.

00:54:56.989 --> 00:54:59.992
THAT'S THE VAULT
HAGRID AND I WENT TO.

00:55:08.914 --> 00:55:10.437
GOOD AFTERNOON, CLASS.

00:55:10.481 --> 00:55:13.135
Class: GOOD AFTERNOON,
MADAME HOOCH.

00:55:13.179 --> 00:55:14.963
GOOD AFTERNOON, AMANDA.
GOOD AFTERNOON.

00:55:16.878 --> 00:55:19.446
WELCOME TO YOUR FIRST
FLYING LESSON.

00:55:19.490 --> 00:55:21.318
WELL, WHAT ARE YOU
WAITING FOR?

00:55:21.361 --> 00:55:23.798
EVERYONE STEP UP TO THE LEFT
SIDE OF THEIR BROOMSTICK.

00:55:23.842 --> 00:55:26.627
COME ON NOW.
HURRY UP.

00:55:26.671 --> 00:55:28.281
STICK YOUR RIGHT HAND
OVER THE BROOM

00:55:28.325 --> 00:55:29.804
AND SAY, "UP."

00:55:29.848 --> 00:55:31.937
Class: UP! UP!

00:55:31.980 --> 00:55:32.938
UP.

00:55:32.981 --> 00:55:34.113
WOW.

00:55:34.156 --> 00:55:35.114
UP.

00:55:35.157 --> 00:55:37.725
UP! UP! UP!

00:55:37.769 --> 00:55:39.510
UP! UP!

00:55:39.553 --> 00:55:40.554
WITH FEELING!

00:55:40.598 --> 00:55:42.904
UP!
UP!

00:55:42.948 --> 00:55:44.863
UP! UP.

00:55:44.906 --> 00:55:47.256
UP. UP. UP.

00:55:47.300 --> 00:55:48.606
UP!

00:55:48.649 --> 00:55:49.737
OH!

00:55:49.781 --> 00:55:52.523
SHUT UP, HARRY.

00:55:52.566 --> 00:55:55.569
NOW, ONCE YOU'VE GOT
HOLD OF YOUR BROOM,

00:55:55.613 --> 00:55:58.877
I WANT YOU TO MOUNT IT
AND GRIP IT TIGHT.

00:55:58.920 --> 00:56:01.575
YOU DON'T WANT TO BE
SLIDING OFF THE END.

00:56:01.619 --> 00:56:04.404
WHEN I BLOW MY WHISTLE,
I WANT EACH OF YOU

00:56:04.448 --> 00:56:07.102
TO KICK OFF
FROM THE GROUND HARD.

00:56:07.146 --> 00:56:10.976
KEEP YOUR BROOMS STEADY,
HOVER FOR A MOMENT,

00:56:11.019 --> 00:56:15.023
THEN LEAN FORWARD SLIGHTLY
AND TOUCH BACK DOWN.

00:56:15.067 --> 00:56:16.634
ON MY WHISTLE--

00:56:16.677 --> 00:56:18.287
3, 2...

00:56:18.331 --> 00:56:19.724
[FWEET]

00:56:19.767 --> 00:56:20.899
OH...

00:56:20.942 --> 00:56:22.596
Hooch:
MR. LONGBOTTOM.

00:56:22.640 --> 00:56:24.076
NEVILLE,
WHAT ARE YOU DOING?

00:56:24.119 --> 00:56:26.034
WE'RE NOT SUPPOSED
TO TAKE OFF YET.

00:56:26.078 --> 00:56:27.122
AAH!

00:56:27.166 --> 00:56:30.125
M-M-MR. LONG--
MR. LONGBOTTOM!

00:56:30.169 --> 00:56:31.605
CAREFUL, NEVILLE!

00:56:31.649 --> 00:56:34.086
WHOA!

00:56:34.129 --> 00:56:35.217
HELP!

00:56:35.261 --> 00:56:36.828
COME BACK DOWN
THIS INSTANT!

00:56:36.871 --> 00:56:38.873
[SCREAMING]

00:56:41.223 --> 00:56:43.225
[GRUNTING]

00:56:45.227 --> 00:56:46.446
HELP!

00:56:47.752 --> 00:56:49.057
MR. LONGBOTTOM!

00:56:50.232 --> 00:56:51.233
AAH!

00:56:52.234 --> 00:56:54.367
WHOA!

00:56:54.411 --> 00:56:55.934
AAH!

00:56:58.153 --> 00:57:00.242
[SHOUTING]
HELP!

00:57:02.331 --> 00:57:03.420
[GRUNTS]

00:57:06.423 --> 00:57:07.380
OW!

00:57:07.424 --> 00:57:09.426
EVERYONE OUT OF THE WAY!

00:57:13.952 --> 00:57:15.823
Hooch: COME ON, GET UP.

00:57:15.867 --> 00:57:16.824
OW! OW!

00:57:16.868 --> 00:57:18.391
OH, OH, OH, OH, DEAR.

00:57:18.435 --> 00:57:19.523
IT'S A BROKEN WRIST.

00:57:19.566 --> 00:57:21.481
TCH, TCH, TCH.
GOOD BOY. COME ON NOW.

00:57:21.525 --> 00:57:23.135
UP YOU GET.

00:57:24.353 --> 00:57:26.573
EVERYONE'S TO KEEP THEIR FEET
FIRMLY ON THE GROUND

00:57:26.617 --> 00:57:29.184
WHILE I TAKE MR. LONGBOTTOM
TO THE HOSPITAL WING.

00:57:29.228 --> 00:57:30.621
UNDERSTAND?

00:57:30.664 --> 00:57:32.884
IF I SEE A SINGLE
BROOM IN THE AIR,

00:57:32.927 --> 00:57:35.495
THE ONE RIDING IT WILL FIND
THEMSELVES OUT OF HOGWARTS

00:57:35.539 --> 00:57:37.410
BEFORE THEY CAN
SAY "QUIDDITCH."

00:57:37.454 --> 00:57:38.498
[LAUGHS]

00:57:38.542 --> 00:57:40.021
DID YOU SEE HIS FACE?

00:57:40.065 --> 00:57:42.502
MAYBE IF THE FAT LUMP
HAD GIVEN THIS A SQUEEZE,

00:57:42.546 --> 00:57:44.896
HE WOULD HAVE REMEMBERED
TO FALL ON HIS FAT ASS.

00:57:44.939 --> 00:57:46.550
GIVE IT HERE, MALFOY.

00:57:48.247 --> 00:57:49.248
NO.

00:57:49.291 --> 00:57:50.249
I THINK I'LL
LEAVE IT SOMEWHERE

00:57:50.292 --> 00:57:51.903
FOR LONGBOTTOM
TO FIND.

00:57:55.776 --> 00:57:57.735
HOW 'BOUT ON THE ROOF?

00:57:59.127 --> 00:58:00.955
WHAT'S THE MATTER, POTTER?

00:58:00.999 --> 00:58:03.567
A BIT BEYOND YOUR REACH?

00:58:05.743 --> 00:58:07.571
HARRY, NO WAY.

00:58:07.614 --> 00:58:09.224
YOU HEARD WHAT
MADAME HOOCH SAID.

00:58:09.268 --> 00:58:11.879
BESIDES, YOU DON'T
EVEN KNOW HOW TO FLY.

00:58:13.359 --> 00:58:15.274
WHAT AN IDIOT.

00:58:18.320 --> 00:58:19.670
GIVE IT HERE,
MALFOY,

00:58:19.713 --> 00:58:21.410
OR I'LL KNOCK YOU
OFF YOUR BROOM!

00:58:21.454 --> 00:58:23.456
IS THAT SO?

00:58:26.807 --> 00:58:29.810
HAVE IT YOUR WAY, THEN.

00:58:55.009 --> 00:58:56.924
[ALL CHEERING]

00:58:59.797 --> 00:59:02.277
THAT WAS WICKED!

00:59:02.321 --> 00:59:03.583
GOOD JOB, HARRY.

00:59:03.627 --> 00:59:06.151
OH, THAT WAS
WICKED, HARRY.

00:59:06.194 --> 00:59:07.369
HARRY POTTER?

00:59:08.893 --> 00:59:10.547
FOLLOW ME.

00:59:13.375 --> 00:59:15.334
[LAUGHS]

00:59:19.643 --> 00:59:23.298
Quirrell: AN IGUANA
SUCH AS THIS IS AN...

00:59:23.342 --> 00:59:24.473
YOU WAIT HERE.

00:59:24.517 --> 00:59:27.259
ESSENTIAL
INGREDIENT IN...

00:59:27.302 --> 00:59:29.087
PROFESSOR QUIRRELL,
EXCUSE ME, EXCUSE ME.

00:59:29.130 --> 00:59:31.611
COULD I BORROW WOOD
FOR A MOMENT, PLEASE?

00:59:31.655 --> 00:59:34.527
OH, Y-YES.
OF COURSE.

00:59:34.571 --> 00:59:37.486
[EERIE ROARING]

00:59:37.530 --> 00:59:39.967
Quirrell:
THE VAMPIRE BAT...

00:59:40.011 --> 00:59:42.013
POTTER, THIS IS
OLIVER WOOD.

00:59:42.056 --> 00:59:45.930
WOOD, I HAVE
FOUND YOU A SEEKER.

00:59:47.845 --> 00:59:49.063
HAVE YOU HEARD?

00:59:49.107 --> 00:59:51.805
HARRY POTTER'S
THE NEW GRYFFINDOR SEEKER.

00:59:51.849 --> 00:59:53.981
I ALWAYS KNEW
HE'D DO WELL.

00:59:54.025 --> 00:59:55.635
SEEKER?

00:59:55.679 --> 00:59:58.551
BUT FIRST YEARS NEVER
MAKE THE HOUSE TEAMS.

00:59:58.595 --> 01:00:01.032
YOU MUST BE THE YOUNGEST
QUIDDITCH PLAYER...

01:00:01.075 --> 01:00:03.121
IN A CENTURY,
ACCORDING TO McGONAGALL.

01:00:03.164 --> 01:00:05.950
HEY, WELL DONE, HARRY.
WOOD'S JUST TOLD US.

01:00:05.993 --> 01:00:07.691
FRED AND GEORGE ARE
ON THE TEAM, TOO...

01:00:07.734 --> 01:00:09.214
BEATERS.

01:00:09.257 --> 01:00:11.042
OUR JOB IS TO MAKE
SURE THAT YOU

01:00:11.085 --> 01:00:12.826
DON'T GET BLOODIED
UP TOO BAD.

01:00:12.870 --> 01:00:14.219
CAN'T MAKE ANY
PROMISES, OF COURSE.

01:00:14.262 --> 01:00:15.699
ROUGH GAME,
QUIDDITCH.

01:00:15.742 --> 01:00:18.223
BRUTAL. BUT NO ONE'S
DIED IN YEARS.

01:00:18.266 --> 01:00:19.703
SOMEONE WILL VANISH
OCCASIONALLY...

01:00:19.746 --> 01:00:22.357
BUT THEY'LL TURN UP
IN A MONTH OR 2!

01:00:22.401 --> 01:00:23.968
OH, GO ON, HARRY.

01:00:24.011 --> 01:00:26.057
QUIDDITCH IS GREAT.

01:00:26.100 --> 01:00:27.406
BEST GAME THERE IS.

01:00:27.449 --> 01:00:28.712
AND YOU'LL
BE GREAT, TOO.

01:00:28.755 --> 01:00:30.757
BUT I'VE NEVER EVEN
PLAYED QUIDDITCH.

01:00:30.801 --> 01:00:32.367
WHAT IF I MAKE
A FOOL OF MYSELF?

01:00:32.411 --> 01:00:34.369
YOU WON'T MAKE
A FOOL OF YOURSELF.

01:00:34.413 --> 01:00:35.719
IT'S IN YOUR BLOOD.

01:00:42.551 --> 01:00:43.944
WHOA.

01:00:43.988 --> 01:00:46.904
HARRY, YOU NEVER
TOLD ME YOUR FATHER

01:00:46.947 --> 01:00:48.340
WAS A SEEKER, TOO.

01:00:48.383 --> 01:00:51.648
I...DIDN'T KNOW.

01:00:57.175 --> 01:00:59.481
I'M TELLING YOU,
IT'S SPOOKY.

01:00:59.525 --> 01:01:01.745
SHE KNOWS MORE
ABOUT YOU THAN YOU DO.

01:01:01.788 --> 01:01:02.746
WHO DOESN'T?

01:01:02.789 --> 01:01:04.138
AAH!
[GASPS]

01:01:04.182 --> 01:01:07.359
WHAT'S HAPPENING?

01:01:07.402 --> 01:01:10.667
THE STAIRCASES
CHANGE, REMEMBER?

01:01:16.760 --> 01:01:18.022
LET'S GO
THIS WAY.

01:01:18.065 --> 01:01:20.764
BEFORE THE STAIRCASE
MOVES AGAIN.

01:01:29.207 --> 01:01:32.776
Ron: DOES ANYBODY FEEL LIKE
WE SHOULDN'T BE HERE?

01:01:32.819 --> 01:01:35.169
WE'RE NOT SUPPOSED
TO BE HERE.

01:01:35.213 --> 01:01:37.694
THIS IS THE THIRD FLOOR.
IT'S FORBIDDEN.

01:01:39.870 --> 01:01:40.827
LET'S GO.

01:01:40.871 --> 01:01:43.003
[MEOWING]

01:01:44.526 --> 01:01:45.484
IT'S FILCH'S CAT!

01:01:45.527 --> 01:01:46.528
RUN!

01:01:50.532 --> 01:01:53.797
QUICK. LET'S HIDE
THROUGH THAT DOOR.

01:01:59.019 --> 01:01:59.977
IT'S LOCKED!

01:02:00.020 --> 01:02:01.805
THAT'S IT.
WE'RE DONE FOR.

01:02:01.848 --> 01:02:03.197
OH, MOVE OVER!

01:02:04.416 --> 01:02:05.634
ALOHOMORA.

01:02:07.027 --> 01:02:08.725
GET IN.

01:02:10.857 --> 01:02:12.206
"ALOHOMORA?"

01:02:12.250 --> 01:02:14.556
STANDARD BOOK OF SPELLS,
CHAPTER 7.

01:02:14.600 --> 01:02:17.385
ANYONE HERE,
MY SWEET?

01:02:17.429 --> 01:02:19.648
[MEOWS]

01:02:24.436 --> 01:02:25.437
COME ON.

01:02:26.438 --> 01:02:27.569
FILCH IS GONE.

01:02:27.613 --> 01:02:28.875
PROBABLY THINKS
THIS DOOR'S LOCKED.

01:02:28.919 --> 01:02:30.007
IT WASLOCKED.

01:02:30.050 --> 01:02:31.835
AND FOR
GOOD REASON.

01:02:31.878 --> 01:02:33.706
[GROWLS]

01:02:35.490 --> 01:02:37.405
[YAWNS]

01:02:37.449 --> 01:02:38.537
[GROWLS]

01:02:40.365 --> 01:02:42.628
[ALL GROWLING]

01:02:43.629 --> 01:02:46.937
AAH!AAH!

01:02:50.984 --> 01:02:52.986
[GRUNTING]

01:02:58.383 --> 01:03:00.080
WHAT DO THEY THINK
THEY'RE DOING,

01:03:00.124 --> 01:03:01.603
KEEPING
A THING LIKE THAT

01:03:01.647 --> 01:03:03.605
LOCKED UP
IN A SCHOOL?

01:03:03.649 --> 01:03:05.869
YOU DON'T USE
YOUR EYES, DO YOU?

01:03:05.912 --> 01:03:07.740
DIDN'T YOU SEE WHAT
IT WAS STANDING ON?

01:03:07.784 --> 01:03:09.916
I WASN'T LOOKING
AT ITS FEET!

01:03:09.960 --> 01:03:12.005
I WAS A BIT PREOCCUPIED
WITH ITS HEADS.

01:03:12.049 --> 01:03:14.268
OR MAYBE YOU
DIDN'T NOTICE

01:03:14.312 --> 01:03:15.356
THERE WERE 3!

01:03:15.400 --> 01:03:16.793
IT WAS STANDING
ON A TRAP DOOR,

01:03:16.836 --> 01:03:18.969
WHICH MEANS IT WASN'T
THERE BY ACCIDENT.

01:03:19.012 --> 01:03:20.579
IT'S GUARDING SOMETHING.

01:03:20.622 --> 01:03:22.755
GUARDING SOMETHING?

01:03:22.799 --> 01:03:24.235
THAT'S RIGHT.

01:03:24.278 --> 01:03:27.064
NOW, IF YOU TWO DON'T MIND,
I'M GOING TO BED

01:03:27.107 --> 01:03:28.500
BEFORE EITHER
OF YOU COME UP

01:03:28.543 --> 01:03:30.763
WITH ANOTHER CLEVER IDEA
TO GET US KILLED.

01:03:30.807 --> 01:03:33.200
OR WORSE, EXPELLED.

01:03:36.943 --> 01:03:40.642
SHE NEEDS TO SORT OUT
HER PRIORITIES.

01:03:46.083 --> 01:03:48.912
QUIDDITCH IS EASY ENOUGH
TO UNDERSTAND.

01:03:48.955 --> 01:03:50.435
EACH TEAM HAS 7 PLAYERS:

01:03:50.478 --> 01:03:52.524
3 CHASERS, 2 BEATERS,

01:03:52.567 --> 01:03:54.265
ONE KEEPER,
AND A SEEKER.

01:03:54.308 --> 01:03:56.006
THAT'S YOU.

01:04:01.315 --> 01:04:02.751
THERE ARE
3 KINDS OF BALLS.

01:04:02.795 --> 01:04:05.537
THIS ONE'S CALLED
THE "QUAFFLE."

01:04:05.580 --> 01:04:07.800
NOW, THE CHASERS
HANDLE THE QUAFFLE

01:04:07.844 --> 01:04:09.410
AND TRY TO PUT IT

01:04:09.454 --> 01:04:11.195
THROUGH ONE
OF THOSE 3 HOOPS.

01:04:11.238 --> 01:04:13.893
THE KEEPER--
THAT'S ME--

01:04:13.937 --> 01:04:15.068
DEFENDS THE HOOPS.

01:04:15.112 --> 01:04:16.287
WITH ME SO FAR?

01:04:16.330 --> 01:04:18.332
I THINK SO.

01:04:18.376 --> 01:04:19.856
WHAT ARE THOSE?

01:04:22.510 --> 01:04:24.512
YOU BETTER TAKE THIS.

01:04:28.429 --> 01:04:30.170
[SQUEALING]

01:04:35.436 --> 01:04:37.221
CAREFUL NOW.
IT'S COMING BACK.

01:04:42.966 --> 01:04:44.968
OH...

01:04:45.011 --> 01:04:47.013
NOT BAD, POTTER.

01:04:47.057 --> 01:04:48.667
YOU'D MAKE
A FAIR BEATER.

01:04:50.582 --> 01:04:51.539
UH-OH.

01:04:51.583 --> 01:04:52.801
OOF!

01:04:53.802 --> 01:04:55.761
[SQUEALING]

01:04:55.804 --> 01:04:57.197
[GRUNTING]

01:05:04.813 --> 01:05:06.337
WHAT WAS THAT?

01:05:08.208 --> 01:05:10.036
A BLUDGER.

01:05:10.080 --> 01:05:11.951
NASTY LITTLE BUGGERS.

01:05:11.995 --> 01:05:14.954
BUT YOU...ARE A SEEKER.

01:05:18.740 --> 01:05:20.351
THE ONLY THING

01:05:20.394 --> 01:05:22.092
I WANT YOU
TO WORRY ABOUT

01:05:22.135 --> 01:05:23.397
IS THIS...

01:05:23.441 --> 01:05:26.705
THE "GOLDEN SNITCH."

01:05:26.748 --> 01:05:28.228
I LIKE THIS BALL.

01:05:28.272 --> 01:05:30.187
AH, YOU LIKE IT NOW.

01:05:30.230 --> 01:05:31.536
JUST WAIT.

01:05:31.579 --> 01:05:32.624
IT'S WICKED FAST

01:05:32.667 --> 01:05:34.582
AND DAMN NEAR
IMPOSSIBLE TO SEE.

01:05:34.626 --> 01:05:36.367
WHAT DO I DO WITH IT?

01:05:36.410 --> 01:05:37.890
YOU CATCH IT...

01:05:37.934 --> 01:05:39.979
BEFORE THE OTHER
TEAM'S SEEKER.

01:05:40.023 --> 01:05:41.807
YOU CATCH THIS,
THE GAME'S OVER.

01:05:41.850 --> 01:05:46.594
YOU CATCH THIS,
POTTER, AND WE WIN.

01:05:47.900 --> 01:05:49.902
[WHIRRING]

01:05:52.687 --> 01:05:53.993
WHOA.

01:05:55.777 --> 01:05:58.780
ONE OF A WIZARD'S
MOST RUDIMENTARY SKILLS

01:05:58.824 --> 01:06:00.695
IS LEVITATION...

01:06:00.739 --> 01:06:04.699
OR THE ABILITY
TO MAKE OBJECTS FLY.

01:06:04.743 --> 01:06:06.788
UH, DO YOU ALL HAVE
YOUR FEATHERS?

01:06:06.832 --> 01:06:07.833
GOOD.

01:06:07.876 --> 01:06:09.226
NOW, UH,

01:06:09.269 --> 01:06:11.228
DON'T FORGET
THE NICE WRIST MOVEMENT

01:06:11.271 --> 01:06:13.143
WE'VE BEEN PRACTICING, HMM?

01:06:13.186 --> 01:06:15.667
THE SWISH AND FLICK.

01:06:15.710 --> 01:06:16.798
EVERYONE.

01:06:16.842 --> 01:06:20.367
All: THE SWISH AND FLICK.

01:06:20.411 --> 01:06:22.979
GOOD. OH, AND ENUNCIATE.

01:06:23.022 --> 01:06:25.982
WINGARDIUM LEVIOSA.

01:06:26.025 --> 01:06:27.940
OFF YOU GO, THEN.

01:06:29.072 --> 01:06:31.465
WINGARDIUM LEVIOSA.

01:06:31.509 --> 01:06:34.033
WINGARDIUM LEVIOSA.

01:06:34.077 --> 01:06:36.862
WINGARDIUM LEVIOSAR.

01:06:38.037 --> 01:06:39.996
NO, STOP,
STOP, STOP.

01:06:40.039 --> 01:06:42.302
YOU'RE GOING TO TAKE
SOMEONE'S EYE OUT.

01:06:42.346 --> 01:06:44.435
BESIDES, YOU'RE
SAYING IT WRONG.

01:06:44.478 --> 01:06:46.654
IT'S LEVI-OSA...

01:06:46.698 --> 01:06:48.308
NOT LEVIO-SAR.

01:06:48.352 --> 01:06:50.789
YOU DO IT, THEN,
IF YOU'RE SO CLEVER.

01:06:50.832 --> 01:06:52.312
GO ON. GO ON.

01:06:54.445 --> 01:06:56.360
WINGARDIUM LEVIOSA.

01:07:04.933 --> 01:07:06.587
OH, WELL DONE!

01:07:06.631 --> 01:07:08.459
SEE HERE, EVERYONE.

01:07:08.502 --> 01:07:10.113
MISS GRANGER'S DONE IT!

01:07:10.156 --> 01:07:12.071
OH, SPLENDID!

01:07:12.115 --> 01:07:13.855
WINGARD LEVIOSA.

01:07:13.899 --> 01:07:14.987
WELL DONE, DEAR.

01:07:15.031 --> 01:07:16.249
[BOOM]

01:07:17.685 --> 01:07:18.686
OOH...

01:07:20.688 --> 01:07:22.212
I THINK WE'RE GOING
TO NEED ANOTHER FEATHER

01:07:22.255 --> 01:07:23.735
OVER HERE, PROFESSOR.

01:07:31.177 --> 01:07:35.486
"IT'S LEVI-OSA,
NOT LEVIO-SAR."

01:07:35.529 --> 01:07:37.792
SHE'S A NIGHTMARE,
HONESTLY.

01:07:37.836 --> 01:07:40.056
NO WONDER SHE HASN'T
GOT ANY FRIENDS.

01:07:41.448 --> 01:07:43.363
I THINK
SHE HEARD YOU.

01:07:46.758 --> 01:07:48.760
[THUNDER]

01:08:05.255 --> 01:08:07.257
[INDISTINCT CHATTER]

01:08:12.523 --> 01:08:14.133
WHERE'S HERMIONE?

01:08:14.177 --> 01:08:16.875
PARVATI PATIL SAID
THAT SHE WOULDN'T COME OUT

01:08:16.918 --> 01:08:18.529
OF THE GIRLS' BATHROOM.

01:08:18.572 --> 01:08:20.487
SHE SAID THAT SHE'D BEEN
IN THERE ALL AFTERNOON

01:08:20.531 --> 01:08:22.098
CRYING.

01:08:27.233 --> 01:08:28.278
TROLL!

01:08:28.321 --> 01:08:30.367
IN THE DUNGEON!

01:08:30.410 --> 01:08:32.717
TROLL IN THE DUNGEON!

01:08:36.851 --> 01:08:38.462
THOUGHT YOU OUGHT TO KNOW.

01:08:40.420 --> 01:08:43.162
AAH! AAH!

01:08:43.206 --> 01:08:44.903
AAH!

01:08:45.904 --> 01:08:49.037
SILENCE!

01:08:50.430 --> 01:08:55.218
EVERYONE WILL PLEASE NOT PANIC.

01:08:55.261 --> 01:08:56.567
NOW...

01:08:56.610 --> 01:08:59.178
PREFECTS
WILL LEAD THEIR HOUSE

01:08:59.222 --> 01:09:01.702
BACK TO THE DORMITORIES.

01:09:01.746 --> 01:09:06.011
TEACHERS WILL FOLLOW ME
TO THE DUNGEONS.

01:09:07.012 --> 01:09:08.492
HUFFLEPUFF,
THIS WAY!

01:09:08.535 --> 01:09:09.841
STAY TOGETHER!

01:09:17.675 --> 01:09:19.981
GRYFFINDORS,
KEEP UP, PLEASE,

01:09:20.025 --> 01:09:21.461
AND STAY ALERT.

01:09:21.505 --> 01:09:23.159
HOW COULD
A TROLL GET IN?

01:09:23.202 --> 01:09:24.334
NOT ON ITS OWN.

01:09:24.377 --> 01:09:26.336
TROLLS ARE
REALLY STUPID.

01:09:26.379 --> 01:09:28.599
PROBABLY PEOPLE
PLAYING JOKES.

01:09:28.642 --> 01:09:29.600
WHAT?

01:09:29.643 --> 01:09:31.993
HERMIONE!
SHE DOESN'T KNOW.

01:09:43.309 --> 01:09:44.789
[FOOTSTEPS THUDDING]

01:09:44.832 --> 01:09:47.357
I THINK THE TROLL
HAS LEFT THE DUNGEON.

01:09:47.400 --> 01:09:49.185
[TROLL GRUNTING]

01:09:52.231 --> 01:09:54.320
IT'S GOING INTO
THE GIRLS' BATHROOM.

01:10:06.027 --> 01:10:07.333
[GRUNTS]

01:10:09.814 --> 01:10:11.816
[GROWLING]

01:10:19.302 --> 01:10:20.390
AAH!

01:10:25.177 --> 01:10:26.396
HERMIONE, MOVE!

01:10:30.748 --> 01:10:33.272
Hermione: HELP!

01:10:33.316 --> 01:10:34.926
Hermione: HELP!

01:10:36.841 --> 01:10:39.235
HEY, PEA BRAIN!

01:10:47.634 --> 01:10:48.809
[GROWLS]

01:10:48.853 --> 01:10:50.420
AAH!

01:10:51.508 --> 01:10:52.639
HELP!

01:10:55.990 --> 01:10:56.991
WHOA!

01:11:02.040 --> 01:11:03.346
WHOA, WHOA!

01:11:05.435 --> 01:11:06.566
EW!

01:11:08.481 --> 01:11:09.482
[SNORTS]

01:11:11.354 --> 01:11:12.964
WHOA, WHOA, WHOA!

01:11:14.618 --> 01:11:15.967
DO SOMETHING!

01:11:16.010 --> 01:11:17.142
[GROWLS]

01:11:18.448 --> 01:11:20.101
WHAT?

01:11:20.145 --> 01:11:21.625
ANYTHING!

01:11:22.887 --> 01:11:23.844
HURRY UP!

01:11:23.888 --> 01:11:25.759
SWISH AND FLICK.

01:11:25.803 --> 01:11:28.109
WINGARDIUM LEVIOSA.

01:11:31.112 --> 01:11:32.462
HMM...

01:11:35.029 --> 01:11:36.030
HUH?

01:11:38.946 --> 01:11:39.947
COOL.

01:11:43.516 --> 01:11:45.344
OH...

01:11:50.784 --> 01:11:54.353
[COUGHING]

01:12:05.408 --> 01:12:08.324
IS IT...DEAD?

01:12:08.367 --> 01:12:09.847
I DON'T THINK SO.

01:12:09.890 --> 01:12:11.675
JUST KNOCKED OUT.

01:12:14.765 --> 01:12:16.375
[GRUNTING]

01:12:17.855 --> 01:12:20.031
OH! TROLL BOGIES.

01:12:21.380 --> 01:12:23.382
OH!

01:12:23.426 --> 01:12:25.210
OH, MY GOODNESS.

01:12:25.253 --> 01:12:27.343
EXPLAIN YOURSELVES,
BOTH OF YOU!

01:12:27.386 --> 01:12:28.648
Both: WELL, WHAT IT IS--

01:12:28.692 --> 01:12:31.042
IT'S MY FAULT,
PROFESSOR McGONAGALL.

01:12:33.392 --> 01:12:35.351
MISS GRANGER.

01:12:35.394 --> 01:12:37.483
I WENT LOOKING
FOR THE TROLL.

01:12:37.527 --> 01:12:38.963
I'D READ
ABOUT THEM

01:12:39.006 --> 01:12:41.008
AND THOUGHT
I COULD HANDLE IT,

01:12:41.052 --> 01:12:43.228
BUT I WAS WRONG.

01:12:43.271 --> 01:12:46.318
IF HARRY AND RON HADN'T
COME AND FOUND ME,

01:12:46.362 --> 01:12:48.668
I'D PROBABLY BE DEAD.

01:12:48.712 --> 01:12:51.062
McGonagall:
BE THAT AS IT MAY...

01:12:51.105 --> 01:12:53.978
IT WAS AN EXTREMELY
FOOLISH THING TO DO.

01:12:54.021 --> 01:12:56.633
I WOULD HAVE EXPECTED MORE
RATIONAL BEHAVIOR ON YOUR PART,

01:12:56.676 --> 01:12:59.897
AND I AM VERY DISAPPOINTED
IN YOU, MISS GRANGER.

01:12:59.940 --> 01:13:02.421
5 POINTS WILL BE TAKEN
FROM GRYFFINDOR

01:13:02.465 --> 01:13:05.859
FOR YOUR SERIOUS
LACK OF JUDGMENT.

01:13:07.600 --> 01:13:09.297
AS FOR YOU
TWO GENTLEMEN--

01:13:09.341 --> 01:13:12.300
I JUST HOPE YOU REALIZE
HOW FORTUNATE YOU ARE.

01:13:12.344 --> 01:13:14.955
NOT MANY FIRST-YEAR
STUDENTS COULD TAKE ON

01:13:14.999 --> 01:13:16.696
A FULLY-GROWN
MOUNTAIN TROLL

01:13:16.740 --> 01:13:19.351
AND LIVE
TO TELL THE TALE.

01:13:19.395 --> 01:13:21.658
5 POINTS...

01:13:22.702 --> 01:13:25.923
WILL BE AWARDED
TO EACH OF YOU...

01:13:27.751 --> 01:13:30.536
FOR SHEER DUMB LUCK.

01:13:36.760 --> 01:13:38.196
PERHAPS YOU OUGHT TO GO.

01:13:38.239 --> 01:13:39.197
M-MIGHT WAKE UP.

01:13:39.240 --> 01:13:40.241
[LAUGHS]

01:13:42.809 --> 01:13:43.767
[GROWLS]

01:13:43.810 --> 01:13:45.116
OH!

01:13:45.159 --> 01:13:46.160
[LAUGHS]

01:13:47.814 --> 01:13:50.730
Ron: TAKE A BIT OF
TOAST, MATE. GO ON.

01:13:50.774 --> 01:13:52.689
RON'S RIGHT, HARRY.

01:13:52.732 --> 01:13:54.821
YOU'RE GONNA NEED
YOUR STRENGTH TODAY.

01:13:54.865 --> 01:13:56.257
I'M NOT HUNGRY.

01:13:57.476 --> 01:13:59.783
GOOD LUCK TODAY, POTTER.

01:14:01.001 --> 01:14:02.133
THEN AGAIN, NOW THAT
YOU'VE PROVEN YOURSELF

01:14:02.176 --> 01:14:03.743
AGAINST A TROLL,
A LITTLE GAME

01:14:03.787 --> 01:14:06.616
OF QUIDDITCH SHOULD BE
EASY WORK FOR YOU...

01:14:06.659 --> 01:14:09.140
EVEN IF IT IS
AGAINST SLYTHERIN.

01:14:17.583 --> 01:14:19.716
THAT EXPLAINS THE BLOOD.

01:14:19.759 --> 01:14:21.108
BLOOD?

01:14:21.152 --> 01:14:23.502
LISTEN. LAST NIGHT,

01:14:23.546 --> 01:14:25.112
I'M GUESSING SNAPE
LET THE TROLL IN

01:14:25.156 --> 01:14:26.200
AS A DIVERSION

01:14:26.244 --> 01:14:27.375
SO HE COULD TRY
AND GET PAST

01:14:27.419 --> 01:14:28.594
THAT 3-HEADED DOG.

01:14:28.638 --> 01:14:30.466
BUT HE GOT HIMSELF
BITTEN.

01:14:30.509 --> 01:14:31.771
THAT'S WHY
HE'S LIMPING.

01:14:31.815 --> 01:14:33.947
BUT WHY WOULD ANYONE
GO NEAR THAT DOG?

01:14:33.991 --> 01:14:35.819
THE DAY I WAS AT GRINGOTTS,

01:14:35.862 --> 01:14:38.082
HAGRID TOOK SOMETHING
OUT OF ONE OF THE VAULTS.

01:14:38.125 --> 01:14:39.257
SAID IT WAS
HOGWARTS BUSINESS,

01:14:39.300 --> 01:14:40.301
VERY SECRET.

01:14:41.346 --> 01:14:42.695
SO YOU'RE SAYING...

01:14:42.739 --> 01:14:44.480
THAT'S WHAT
THE DOG'S GUARDING.

01:14:44.523 --> 01:14:46.569
THAT'S
WHAT SNAPE WANTS.

01:14:46.612 --> 01:14:48.396
[OWL SCREECHES]

01:14:59.756 --> 01:15:01.801
BIT EARLY FOR MAIL,
ISN'T IT?

01:15:01.845 --> 01:15:04.543
BUT I--I NEVER GET MAIL.

01:15:04.587 --> 01:15:06.632
LET'S OPEN IT.

01:15:16.729 --> 01:15:18.035
IT'S A BROOMSTICK.

01:15:18.078 --> 01:15:20.559
THAT'S NOT JUST
A BROOMSTICK, HARRY.

01:15:20.603 --> 01:15:22.953
IT'S A NIMBUS 2000.

01:15:24.084 --> 01:15:25.303
BUT WHO?

01:15:47.804 --> 01:15:48.761
SCARED, HARRY?

01:15:48.805 --> 01:15:50.502
A LITTLE.

01:15:50.546 --> 01:15:51.938
THAT'S ALL RIGHT.

01:15:51.982 --> 01:15:54.462
I FELT THE SAME WAY
BEFORE MY FIRST GAME.

01:15:54.506 --> 01:15:55.768
WHAT HAPPENED?

01:15:55.812 --> 01:15:58.118
I, UH, I DON'T
REALLY REMEMBER.

01:15:58.162 --> 01:16:00.512
I TOOK A BLUDGER TO
THE HEAD 2 MINUTES IN.

01:16:00.556 --> 01:16:03.167
WOKE UP IN THE HOSPITAL
A WEEK LATER.

01:16:05.473 --> 01:16:07.475
[CROWD CHEERING]

01:16:26.146 --> 01:16:28.409
HELLO, AND WELCOME
TO HOGWARTS' FIRST

01:16:28.453 --> 01:16:29.672
QUIDDITCH GAME
OF THE SEASON.

01:16:29.715 --> 01:16:33.197
TODAY'S GAME--
SLYTHERIN VERSUS GRYFFINDOR!

01:16:33.240 --> 01:16:35.591
[CHEERING]

01:16:39.420 --> 01:16:41.379
GRYFFINDOR!

01:17:05.142 --> 01:17:06.709
Lee: THE PLAYERS
TAKE THEIR POSITIONS

01:17:06.752 --> 01:17:08.928
AS MADAME HOOCH
STEPS OUT ONTO THE FIELD

01:17:08.972 --> 01:17:11.409
TO BEGIN THE GAME!

01:17:11.452 --> 01:17:15.021
NOW I WANT
A NICE CLEAN GAME...

01:17:15.065 --> 01:17:17.067
FROM ALL OF YOU!

01:17:23.334 --> 01:17:24.683
Lee: THE BLUDGERS ARE UP...

01:17:24.727 --> 01:17:26.511
FOLLOWED BY
THE GOLDEN SNITCH.

01:17:26.554 --> 01:17:28.644
REMEMBER, THE SNITCH
IS WORTH 150 POINTS.

01:17:28.687 --> 01:17:33.344
THE SEEKER WHO CATCHES
THE SNITCH ENDS THE GAME.

01:17:38.523 --> 01:17:40.307
THE QUAFFLE IS RELEASED...

01:17:40.351 --> 01:17:43.310
AND THE GAME BEGINS!

01:17:59.849 --> 01:18:01.807
[BELL RINGS]

01:18:01.851 --> 01:18:06.072
ANGELINA JOHNSON SCORES!
10 POINTS FOR GRYFFINDOR!

01:18:08.858 --> 01:18:10.729
YES! WHOA.

01:18:11.817 --> 01:18:13.253
WELL DONE!

01:18:17.170 --> 01:18:19.825
Lee: SLYTHERIN TAKES
POSSESSION OF THE QUAFFLE.

01:18:19.869 --> 01:18:22.567
BLETCHLEY PASSES
TO CAPTAIN MARCUS FLINT.

01:18:51.335 --> 01:18:53.337
[BELL RINGS]

01:18:54.381 --> 01:18:55.426
YES!

01:18:55.469 --> 01:18:58.255
ANOTHER 10 POINTS
TO GRYFFINDOR!

01:19:11.529 --> 01:19:13.183
GIVE ME THAT!

01:19:21.626 --> 01:19:23.802
[CROWD BOOING]

01:19:26.283 --> 01:19:28.851
[LAUGHING]

01:19:37.729 --> 01:19:38.991
[BELL RINGS]

01:19:45.302 --> 01:19:47.173
TAKE THAT SIDE.

01:20:12.503 --> 01:20:13.896
[BELL RINGS]

01:20:34.786 --> 01:20:36.962
WHOA! WHOA!

01:20:37.006 --> 01:20:40.096
Hagrid: WHAT'S GOING ON
WITH HARRY'S BROOMSTICK?

01:20:49.845 --> 01:20:52.108
IT'S SNAPE!
HE'S JINXING THE BROOM!

01:20:52.151 --> 01:20:54.371
JINXING THE BROOM?
WHAT DO WE DO?

01:20:54.414 --> 01:20:55.763
LEAVE IT TO ME.

01:21:17.960 --> 01:21:19.787
COME ON, HERMIONE!

01:21:33.627 --> 01:21:35.978
LACARNUM INFLAMARAE.

01:21:44.421 --> 01:21:45.552
FIRE!

01:21:45.596 --> 01:21:46.814
YOU'RE ON FIRE!

01:21:46.858 --> 01:21:48.033
WHAT? OH!

01:22:05.355 --> 01:22:06.312
GO!

01:22:06.356 --> 01:22:07.618
GO, GO, GO!

01:22:46.309 --> 01:22:48.050
UNH!

01:22:53.229 --> 01:22:54.491
[ALL GASPING]

01:22:58.625 --> 01:23:01.019
LOOKS LIKE HE'S GONNA BE SICK.

01:23:02.978 --> 01:23:04.501
Lee:
HE'S GOT THE SNITCH!

01:23:04.544 --> 01:23:07.069
HARRY POTTER
RECEIVES 150 POINTS

01:23:07.112 --> 01:23:08.070
FOR CATCHING THE SNITCH.

01:23:08.113 --> 01:23:10.768
[FWEET]
GRYFFINDOR WINS.

01:23:10.811 --> 01:23:12.726
[CHEERING]

01:23:14.293 --> 01:23:15.773
NO.

01:23:19.429 --> 01:23:20.952
YES!

01:23:20.996 --> 01:23:22.910
WHOO-HOO!

01:23:25.000 --> 01:23:27.045
[CHUCKLES]

01:23:34.400 --> 01:23:36.576
[CROWD CHEERING]

01:23:45.324 --> 01:23:47.674
Crowd:
GO, GO, GRYFFINDOR!

01:23:47.718 --> 01:23:49.415
GO, GO, GRYFFINDOR!

01:23:49.459 --> 01:23:51.417
GO, GO, GRYFFINDOR!

01:23:51.461 --> 01:23:53.202
GO, GO, GRYFFINDOR!

01:23:54.290 --> 01:23:55.639
Hagrid: NONSENSE.

01:23:55.682 --> 01:23:57.380
WHY WOULD SNAPE
PUT A CURSE

01:23:57.423 --> 01:23:58.424
ON HARRY'S BROOM?

01:23:58.468 --> 01:23:59.469
WHO KNOWS?

01:23:59.512 --> 01:24:00.557
WHY WAS HE TRYING
TO GET PAST

01:24:00.600 --> 01:24:01.993
THAT 3-HEADED DOG
ON HALLOWEEN?

01:24:02.037 --> 01:24:04.256
WHO TOLD YOU
ABOUT FLUFFY?

01:24:04.300 --> 01:24:05.475
FLUFFY?

01:24:05.518 --> 01:24:07.085
THAT THING
HAS A NAME?

01:24:07.129 --> 01:24:08.260
WELL, OF COURSE
HE'S GOT A NAME.

01:24:08.304 --> 01:24:09.348
HE'S MINE.

01:24:09.392 --> 01:24:10.480
I BOUGHT HIM
OFF AN IRISH FELLER

01:24:10.523 --> 01:24:12.351
I MET DOWN AT THE PUB
LAST YEAR.

01:24:12.395 --> 01:24:13.831
THEN I LENT HIM TO
DUMBLEDORE TO GUARD THE...

01:24:13.874 --> 01:24:15.137
YES?

01:24:15.180 --> 01:24:17.008
SHOULDN'T HAVE SAID THAT.
NO MORE QUESTIONS.

01:24:17.052 --> 01:24:18.357
DON'T ASK
ANY MORE QUESTIONS.

01:24:18.401 --> 01:24:20.098
THAT'S TOP SECRET, THAT IS.

01:24:20.142 --> 01:24:21.099
BUT, HAGRID,

01:24:21.143 --> 01:24:22.318
WHATEVER
FLUFFY'S GUARDING,

01:24:22.361 --> 01:24:24.189
SNAPE'S TRYING
TO STEAL IT.

01:24:24.233 --> 01:24:25.799
CODSWALLOP.

01:24:25.843 --> 01:24:27.758
PROFESSOR SNAPE
IS A HOGWARTS TEACHER.

01:24:27.801 --> 01:24:29.673
HOGWARTS TEACHER
OR NOT,

01:24:29.716 --> 01:24:31.892
I KNOW A SPELL
WHEN I SEE ONE.

01:24:31.936 --> 01:24:33.372
I'VE READ
ALL ABOUT THEM.

01:24:33.416 --> 01:24:35.070
YOU'VE GOT TO KEEP
EYE CONTACT,

01:24:35.113 --> 01:24:37.333
AND SNAPE
WASN'T BLINKING.

01:24:37.376 --> 01:24:38.464
EXACTLY.

01:24:38.508 --> 01:24:39.987
[SIGHS]

01:24:40.031 --> 01:24:42.816
NOW YOU LISTEN TO ME,
ALL THREE OF YOU.

01:24:42.860 --> 01:24:44.079
YOU'RE MEDDLING
IN THINGS

01:24:44.122 --> 01:24:45.602
THAT OUGHT NOT
TO BE MEDDLED IN.

01:24:45.645 --> 01:24:47.908
IT'S DANGEROUS.

01:24:47.952 --> 01:24:49.127
WHAT THAT DOG
IS GUARDING

01:24:49.171 --> 01:24:51.129
IS STRICTLY BETWEEN
PROFESSOR DUMBLEDORE

01:24:51.173 --> 01:24:52.348
AND NICHOLAS FLAMEL.

01:24:52.391 --> 01:24:54.741
NICHOLAS FLAMEL?

01:24:54.785 --> 01:24:57.048
I SHOULDN'T
HAVE SAID THAT.

01:24:57.092 --> 01:24:59.224
I SHOULD NOT
HAVE SAID THAT.

01:24:59.268 --> 01:25:00.225
I SHOULDN'T
HAVE SAID THAT.

01:25:00.269 --> 01:25:02.140
NICHOLAS FLAMEL.

01:25:02.184 --> 01:25:04.708
Harry:
WHO'S NICHOLAS FLAMEL?

01:25:04.751 --> 01:25:07.667
I DON'T KNOW.

01:25:25.772 --> 01:25:27.339
Ghosts:
♪ MERRY CHRISTMAS

01:25:27.383 --> 01:25:28.645
♪ MERRY CHRISTMAS

01:25:28.688 --> 01:25:32.039
♪ RING THE HOGWART BELL

01:25:32.083 --> 01:25:33.302
♪ MERRY CHRISTMAS

01:25:33.345 --> 01:25:35.130
♪ MERRY CHRISTMAS

01:25:50.841 --> 01:25:53.626
KNIGHT TO E-5.

01:26:01.156 --> 01:26:04.681
QUEEN TO E-5.

01:26:10.252 --> 01:26:11.775
THAT'S TOTALLY BARBARIC.

01:26:11.818 --> 01:26:14.604
THAT'S WIZARD'S CHESS.

01:26:14.647 --> 01:26:15.866
I SEE YOU'VE PACKED.

01:26:15.909 --> 01:26:17.389
SEE YOU HAVEN'T.

01:26:17.433 --> 01:26:18.608
CHANGE OF PLANS.

01:26:18.651 --> 01:26:20.740
MY PARENTS DECIDED
TO GO TO ROMANIA

01:26:20.784 --> 01:26:22.960
TO VISIT
MY BROTHER CHARLIE.

01:26:23.003 --> 01:26:24.440
HE'S STUDYING
DRAGONS THERE.

01:26:24.483 --> 01:26:26.877
GOOD. YOU CAN
HELP HARRY, THEN.

01:26:26.920 --> 01:26:28.531
HE'S GOING TO GO
AND LOOK IN THE LIBRARY

01:26:28.574 --> 01:26:30.794
FOR INFORMATION
ON NICHOLAS FLAMEL.

01:26:30.837 --> 01:26:34.624
WE'VE LOOKED
A HUNDRED TIMES.

01:26:34.667 --> 01:26:37.061
NOT IN
THE RESTRICTED SECTION.

01:26:37.104 --> 01:26:38.932
HAPPY CHRISTMAS.

01:26:42.197 --> 01:26:45.287
I THINK WE'VE HAD
A BAD INFLUENCE ON HER.

01:26:47.680 --> 01:26:49.247
Ron: HARRY, WAKE UP!

01:26:49.291 --> 01:26:51.162
COME ON,
HARRY, WAKE UP!

01:27:01.738 --> 01:27:03.261
HAPPY CHRISTMAS,
HARRY.

01:27:03.305 --> 01:27:05.220
HAPPY CHRISTMAS, RON.

01:27:05.263 --> 01:27:06.699
WHAT ARE YOU WEARING?

01:27:08.179 --> 01:27:10.312
OH. MY MUM MADE IT.

01:27:10.355 --> 01:27:12.183
LOOKS LIKE
YOU'VE GOT ONE, TOO.

01:27:12.227 --> 01:27:14.490
I'VE GOT PRESENTS?

01:27:14.533 --> 01:27:15.708
YEAH.

01:27:22.672 --> 01:27:24.500
THERE THEY ARE.

01:27:36.163 --> 01:27:38.078
"YOUR FATHER LEFT THIS
IN MY POSSESSION

01:27:38.122 --> 01:27:39.558
"BEFORE HE DIED.

01:27:39.602 --> 01:27:41.952
"IT IS TIME IT WAS
RETURNED TO YOU.

01:27:41.995 --> 01:27:44.041
USE IT WELL."

01:28:00.579 --> 01:28:02.102
WHAT IS IT?

01:28:02.146 --> 01:28:04.627
SOME KIND OF CLOAK.

01:28:04.670 --> 01:28:06.629
WELL, LET'S SEE, THEN.
PUT IT ON.

01:28:09.632 --> 01:28:12.112
[GASPS] WHOA!

01:28:13.331 --> 01:28:14.593
MY BODY'S GONE!

01:28:14.637 --> 01:28:16.203
I KNOW WHAT THAT IS.

01:28:16.247 --> 01:28:18.380
THAT'S AN
INVISIBILITY CLOAK.

01:28:18.423 --> 01:28:20.773
I'M INVISIBLE?

01:28:20.817 --> 01:28:22.732
THEY'RE REALLY RARE.

01:28:24.429 --> 01:28:25.778
WONDER WHO GAVE IT TO YOU.

01:28:25.822 --> 01:28:27.127
THERE WAS NO NAME.

01:28:27.171 --> 01:28:31.001
IT JUST SAID...
"USE IT WELL."

01:28:50.847 --> 01:28:52.849
[CREAKING]

01:28:58.507 --> 01:29:01.031
"FAMOUS FIRE-EATERS."

01:29:01.074 --> 01:29:04.034
"15th-CENTURY FIENDS."

01:29:04.077 --> 01:29:06.210
FLAMEL.

01:29:06.253 --> 01:29:08.343
NICHOLAS FLAMEL.

01:29:08.386 --> 01:29:09.779
WHERE ARE YOU?

01:29:24.271 --> 01:29:26.491
AAH!

01:29:28.885 --> 01:29:30.800
Filch: WHO'S THERE?

01:29:37.894 --> 01:29:39.678
Filch:
I KNOW YOU'RE IN THERE.

01:29:39.722 --> 01:29:42.507
YOU CAN'T HIDE.

01:29:50.515 --> 01:29:51.995
WHO IS IT?

01:29:52.038 --> 01:29:53.649
SHOW YOURSELF.

01:30:22.199 --> 01:30:24.941
[CAT MEOWING]

01:30:41.392 --> 01:30:43.089
Quirrell:
SEVERUS, I THOUGHT...

01:30:43.133 --> 01:30:47.050
YOU DON'T WANT ME
AS YOUR ENEMY, QUIRRELL.

01:30:48.704 --> 01:30:49.922
WH-WHAT DO Y-YOU MEAN?

01:30:49.966 --> 01:30:51.184
YOU KNOW PERFECTLY WELL
WHAT I MEAN.

01:31:09.028 --> 01:31:11.727
WE'LL HAVE ANOTHER
LITTLE CHAT SOON,

01:31:11.770 --> 01:31:14.120
WHEN YOU'VE
HAD TIME TO DECIDE

01:31:14.164 --> 01:31:17.950
WHERE YOUR
LOYALTIES LIE.

01:31:17.994 --> 01:31:19.604
OH. PROFESSORS,

01:31:19.648 --> 01:31:23.478
I FOUND THIS IN
THE RESTRICTED SECTION.

01:31:23.521 --> 01:31:25.610
IT'S STILL HOT.

01:31:25.654 --> 01:31:28.004
THAT MEANS THERE'S
A STUDENT OUT OF BED.

01:33:00.357 --> 01:33:01.663
MUM?

01:33:05.884 --> 01:33:07.103
DAD?

01:33:42.617 --> 01:33:44.706
Harry: RON, YOU'VE
REALLY GOT TO SEE THIS!

01:33:44.749 --> 01:33:46.533
RON, YOU'VE GOT
TO SEE THIS!

01:33:49.362 --> 01:33:51.408
RON!
RON, COME ON.

01:33:51.451 --> 01:33:52.670
GET OUT OF BED.

01:33:52.714 --> 01:33:53.845
WHY?

01:33:53.889 --> 01:33:54.846
THERE'S SOMETHING
YOU'VE GOT TO SEE.

01:33:54.890 --> 01:33:56.500
NOW COME ON.

01:34:02.854 --> 01:34:04.464
COME ON. COME.

01:34:04.508 --> 01:34:06.031
COME LOOK.
IT'S MY PARENTS.

01:34:08.555 --> 01:34:10.645
I ONLY SEE US.

01:34:10.688 --> 01:34:14.257
LOOK IN PROPERLY.
GO ON, STAND THERE.

01:34:14.300 --> 01:34:15.258
THERE.

01:34:15.301 --> 01:34:16.433
YOU SEE THEM,
DON'T YOU?

01:34:16.476 --> 01:34:18.174
THAT'S ME,

01:34:18.217 --> 01:34:20.567
ONLY I'M HEAD BOY,

01:34:20.611 --> 01:34:23.440
AND I'M HOLDING
THE QUIDDITCH CUP.

01:34:23.483 --> 01:34:25.529
AND BLOODY HELL!

01:34:25.572 --> 01:34:27.879
I'M QUIDDITCH
CAPTAIN, TOO.

01:34:27.923 --> 01:34:31.666
I LOOK GOOD.

01:34:31.709 --> 01:34:35.844
HARRY, DO YOU THINK THIS
MIRROR SHOWS THE FUTURE?

01:34:35.887 --> 01:34:37.759
HOW CAN IT?

01:34:37.802 --> 01:34:39.935
BOTH MY PARENTS ARE DEAD.

01:34:44.417 --> 01:34:46.419
[RAINING]

01:35:03.915 --> 01:35:06.483
BACK AGAIN, HARRY?

01:35:09.399 --> 01:35:12.054
I SEE THAT YOU,
LIKE SO MANY BEFORE YOU,

01:35:12.097 --> 01:35:15.405
HAVE DISCOVERED THE DELIGHTS
OF THE MIRROR OF ERISED.

01:35:15.448 --> 01:35:20.889
I TRUST BY NOW
YOU REALIZE WHAT IT DOES.

01:35:20.932 --> 01:35:24.936
LET ME GIVE YOU A CLUE.

01:35:24.980 --> 01:35:27.504
THE HAPPIEST MAN ON EARTH

01:35:27.547 --> 01:35:28.940
WOULD LOOK INTO THE MIRROR

01:35:28.984 --> 01:35:32.770
AND SEE ONLY HIMSELF
EXACTLY AS HE IS.

01:35:32.814 --> 01:35:36.818
SO THEN IT SHOWS US
WHAT WE WANT?

01:35:36.861 --> 01:35:38.689
WHATEVER WE WANT?

01:35:38.733 --> 01:35:41.561
YES...AND NO.

01:35:41.605 --> 01:35:44.826
IT SHOWS US
NOTHING MORE OR LESS

01:35:44.869 --> 01:35:46.088
THAN THE DEEPEST

01:35:46.131 --> 01:35:51.136
AND MOST DESPERATE
DESIRES OF OUR HEARTS.

01:35:51.180 --> 01:35:53.225
NOW YOU, HARRY,

01:35:53.269 --> 01:35:54.879
WHO HAVE NEVER KNOWN
YOUR FAMILY,

01:35:54.923 --> 01:36:00.276
YOU SEE THEM
STANDING BESIDE YOU.

01:36:00.319 --> 01:36:03.061
BUT REMEMBER THIS,
HARRY--

01:36:03.105 --> 01:36:05.934
THIS MIRROR GIVES US

01:36:05.977 --> 01:36:12.027
NEITHER KNOWLEDGE
OR TRUTH.

01:36:12.070 --> 01:36:15.465
MEN HAVE WASTED AWAY
IN FRONT OF IT,

01:36:15.508 --> 01:36:17.597
EVEN GONE MAD.

01:36:19.338 --> 01:36:21.819
THAT IS WHY TOMORROW
IT WILL BE MOVED

01:36:21.863 --> 01:36:23.603
TO A NEW HOME.

01:36:23.647 --> 01:36:25.780
AND I MUST ASK YOU

01:36:25.823 --> 01:36:31.046
NOT TO GO LOOKING
FOR IT AGAIN.

01:36:31.089 --> 01:36:32.438
IT DOES NOT DO

01:36:32.482 --> 01:36:34.440
TO DWELL ON DREAMS,
HARRY,

01:36:34.484 --> 01:36:37.443
AND FORGET TO LIVE.

01:36:55.853 --> 01:36:57.724
[SCREECHES]

01:37:32.237 --> 01:37:34.805
I HAD YOU LOOKING
IN THE WRONG SECTION.

01:37:34.849 --> 01:37:38.374
HOW COULD I BE
SO STUPID?

01:37:38.417 --> 01:37:40.028
I CHECKED THIS OUT
WEEKS AGO

01:37:40.071 --> 01:37:41.072
FOR A BIT
OF LIGHT READING.

01:37:41.116 --> 01:37:43.814
THIS IS LIGHT?

01:37:47.992 --> 01:37:50.516
OF COURSE, HERE IT IS!

01:37:50.560 --> 01:37:53.215
NICHOLAS FLAMEL IS
THE ONLY KNOWN MAKER

01:37:53.258 --> 01:37:54.956
OF THE PHILOSOPHER'S STONE.

01:37:54.999 --> 01:37:56.435
THE WHAT?
THE WHAT?

01:37:56.479 --> 01:37:58.829
HONESTLY,
DON'T YOU TWO READ?

01:38:00.265 --> 01:38:01.919
"THE PHILOSOPHER'S STONE

01:38:01.963 --> 01:38:04.704
"IS A LEGENDARY SUBSTANCE
WITH ASTONISHING POWERS.

01:38:04.748 --> 01:38:07.446
"IT CAN TRANSFORM
ANY METAL INTO PURE GOLD

01:38:07.490 --> 01:38:09.579
"AND PRODUCES
THE ELIXIR OF LIFE,

01:38:09.622 --> 01:38:11.581
WHICH WILL MAKE
THE DRINKER IMMORTAL."

01:38:11.624 --> 01:38:12.582
IMMORTAL?

01:38:12.625 --> 01:38:14.279
IT MEANS YOU'LL NEVER DIE.

01:38:14.323 --> 01:38:15.280
I KNOW WHAT IT MEANS!

01:38:15.324 --> 01:38:16.673
SHH!

01:38:16.716 --> 01:38:20.546
"THE ONLY STONE CURRENTLY
IN EXISTENCE BELONGS

01:38:20.590 --> 01:38:23.549
"TO MR. NICHOLAS FLAMEL,
THE NOTED ALCHEMIST,

01:38:23.593 --> 01:38:29.077
WHO LAST YEAR CELEBRATED
HIS 665th BIRTHDAY."

01:38:29.120 --> 01:38:31.122
THAT'S WHAT FLUFFY'S
GUARDING ON THE THIRD FLOOR.

01:38:31.166 --> 01:38:32.950
THAT'S WHAT'S
UNDER THE TRAPDOOR--

01:38:32.994 --> 01:38:34.256
THE PHILOSOPHER'S STONE.

01:38:48.487 --> 01:38:51.882
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

01:38:51.926 --> 01:38:52.970
HAGRID!

01:38:53.014 --> 01:38:54.015
OH, HELLO.

01:38:54.058 --> 01:38:55.494
SORRY, DON'T WISH
TO BE RUDE,

01:38:55.538 --> 01:38:56.887
BUT I'M IN NO FIT STATE
TO ENTERTAIN TODAY.

01:38:56.931 --> 01:38:59.063
All: WE KNOW ABOUT
THE PHILOSOPHER'S STONE!

01:39:00.630 --> 01:39:02.458
OH.

01:39:04.634 --> 01:39:06.070
WE THINK SNAPE'S
TRYING TO STEAL IT.

01:39:06.114 --> 01:39:08.029
SNAPE? BLIMEY,
YOU'RE NOT STILL ON

01:39:08.072 --> 01:39:09.465
ABOUT HIM, ARE YOU?

01:39:09.508 --> 01:39:11.380
HAGRID, WE KNOW
HE'S AFTER THE STONE.

01:39:11.423 --> 01:39:12.642
WE JUST DON'T KNOW WHY.

01:39:12.685 --> 01:39:14.426
SNAPE IS ONE
OF THE TEACHERS

01:39:14.470 --> 01:39:15.819
PROTECTING THE STONE.

01:39:15.862 --> 01:39:16.820
HE'S NOT ABOUT
TO STEAL IT.

01:39:16.863 --> 01:39:18.430
WHAT?

01:39:18.474 --> 01:39:19.954
YOU HEARD.

01:39:19.997 --> 01:39:22.086
RIGHT. COME ON NOW.
I'M A BIT PREOCCUPIED TODAY.

01:39:22.130 --> 01:39:25.089
Harry: WAIT A MINUTE.
ONE OF THE TEACHERS?

01:39:25.133 --> 01:39:27.048
OF COURSE! THERE ARE
OTHER THINGS

01:39:27.091 --> 01:39:29.093
DEFENDING THE STONE,
AREN'T THERE?

01:39:29.137 --> 01:39:30.442
SPELLS,
ENCHANTMENTS.

01:39:30.486 --> 01:39:31.966
THAT'S RIGHT.

01:39:32.009 --> 01:39:35.273
WASTE OF BLOODY TIME,
IF YOU ASK ME.

01:39:35.317 --> 01:39:37.667
AIN'T NO ONE GONNA
GET PAST FLUFFY.

01:39:37.710 --> 01:39:38.973
AIN'T A SOUL KNOWS HOW,

01:39:39.016 --> 01:39:41.410
EXCEPT FOR ME
AND DUMBLEDORE.

01:39:41.453 --> 01:39:42.802
I SHOULDN'T HAVE
TOLD YOU THAT.

01:39:42.846 --> 01:39:43.978
I SHOULD NOT HAVE
TOLD YOU THAT.

01:39:44.021 --> 01:39:46.371
[POT RATTLING]

01:39:49.418 --> 01:39:51.594
OH! OOH! OH!

01:39:51.637 --> 01:39:54.249
OOH! OOH! OOH!

01:39:58.296 --> 01:40:00.951
UH, HAGRID,
WHAT EXACTLY IS THAT?

01:40:00.995 --> 01:40:04.085
THAT? IT'S A--
IT'S, UM--

01:40:04.128 --> 01:40:06.391
I KNOW WHAT THAT IS!

01:40:06.435 --> 01:40:09.264
BUT, HAGRID,
HOW DID YOU GET ONE?

01:40:09.307 --> 01:40:10.439
I WON IT...

01:40:10.482 --> 01:40:12.571
OFF A STRANGER
I MET DOWN AT THE PUB.

01:40:12.615 --> 01:40:14.269
SEEMED QUITE GLAD
TO BE RID OF IT,

01:40:14.312 --> 01:40:15.966
AS A MATTER OF FACT.

01:40:16.010 --> 01:40:19.143
[CRACKING]

01:40:35.681 --> 01:40:38.858
[DRAGON SCREECHES]

01:40:38.902 --> 01:40:42.210
IS THAT...

01:40:42.253 --> 01:40:43.776
A DRAGON?

01:40:43.820 --> 01:40:45.213
THAT'S NOT
JUST A DRAGON.

01:40:45.256 --> 01:40:47.345
THAT'S A NORWEGIAN
RIDGEBACK.

01:40:47.389 --> 01:40:50.044
MY BROTHER CHARLIE
WORKS WITH THESE

01:40:50.087 --> 01:40:51.393
IN ROMANIA.

01:40:51.436 --> 01:40:52.959
ISN'T HE BEAUTIFUL?

01:40:53.003 --> 01:40:55.005
OH, BLESS HIM.
LOOK, HE KNOWS HIS MUMMY.

01:40:55.049 --> 01:40:56.702
[CHUCKLES]

01:40:56.746 --> 01:40:57.747
HELLO, NORBERT.

01:40:57.790 --> 01:40:58.791
[SQUEALS]

01:40:58.835 --> 01:41:00.532
NORBERT?

01:41:00.576 --> 01:41:02.360
YEAH, WELL, HE'S GOT
TO HAVE A NAME, DOESN'T HE?

01:41:03.970 --> 01:41:05.102
DON'T YOU, NORBERT?

01:41:05.146 --> 01:41:07.365
EH? DEE-DEE-DEE!

01:41:07.409 --> 01:41:08.453
[HICCUPS]

01:41:08.497 --> 01:41:10.238
OOH!

01:41:10.281 --> 01:41:11.369
OOH, OOH, OOH!

01:41:11.413 --> 01:41:13.110
OOH! WELL...

01:41:13.154 --> 01:41:15.112
HE'LL HAVE TO BE
TRAINED UP A BIT, OF COURSE.

01:41:18.115 --> 01:41:20.291
[SCREECHES]

01:41:20.335 --> 01:41:21.553
WHO'S THAT?

01:41:24.121 --> 01:41:25.296
MALFOY.

01:41:27.168 --> 01:41:28.604
OH, DEAR.

01:41:28.647 --> 01:41:30.171
[SCREECHES]

01:41:30.214 --> 01:41:32.260
Harry: HAGRID ALWAYS
WANTED A DRAGON.

01:41:32.303 --> 01:41:35.132
TOLD ME SO THE FIRST TIME
I EVER MET HIM.

01:41:35.176 --> 01:41:37.047
Ron: IT'S CRAZY.

01:41:37.091 --> 01:41:39.441
AND WORSE, MALFOY KNOWS.

01:41:39.484 --> 01:41:40.616
Harry: I DON'T
UNDERSTAND.

01:41:40.659 --> 01:41:41.617
IS THAT BAD?

01:41:41.660 --> 01:41:43.662
IT'S BAD.

01:41:43.706 --> 01:41:45.360
GOOD EVENING.

01:41:48.885 --> 01:41:52.541
NOTHING,
I REPEAT, NOTHING

01:41:52.584 --> 01:41:54.412
GIVES A STUDENT THE RIGHT

01:41:54.456 --> 01:41:56.501
TO WALK ABOUT
THE SCHOOL AT NIGHT.

01:41:56.545 --> 01:41:59.678
THEREFORE, AS PUNISHMENT
FOR YOUR ACTIONS,

01:41:59.722 --> 01:42:01.332
50 POINTS WILL BE TAKEN.

01:42:01.376 --> 01:42:02.899
50?

01:42:02.942 --> 01:42:04.161
EACH.

01:42:04.205 --> 01:42:07.556
AND TO ENSURE IT
DOESN'T HAPPEN AGAIN,

01:42:07.599 --> 01:42:11.864
ALL FOUR OF YOU
WILL RECEIVE DETENTION.

01:42:11.908 --> 01:42:13.214
EXCUSE ME, PROFESSOR.

01:42:13.257 --> 01:42:14.780
PERHAPS I HEARD YOU WRONG.

01:42:14.824 --> 01:42:16.608
I THOUGHT YOU SAID
THE FOUR OF US.

01:42:16.652 --> 01:42:20.090
NO, YOU HEARD ME
CORRECTLY, MR. MALFOY.

01:42:20.134 --> 01:42:22.179
YOU SEE, HONORABLE
AS YOUR INTENTIONS WERE,

01:42:22.223 --> 01:42:25.443
YOU TOO WERE OUT
OF BED AFTER HOURS.

01:42:25.487 --> 01:42:27.489
YOU WILL JOIN
YOUR CLASSMATES

01:42:27.532 --> 01:42:28.881
IN DETENTION.

01:42:39.675 --> 01:42:44.158
A PITY THEY LET
THE OLD PUNISHMENTS DIE.

01:42:44.201 --> 01:42:45.724
THERE WAS A TIME
DETENTION WOULD FIND YOU

01:42:45.768 --> 01:42:49.032
HANGING BY YOUR THUMBS
IN THE DUNGEONS.

01:42:49.075 --> 01:42:52.078
GOD, I MISS
THE SCREAMING.

01:42:54.646 --> 01:42:57.780
YOU'LL BE SERVING DETENTION
WITH HAGRID TONIGHT.

01:42:57.823 --> 01:42:59.869
HE'S GOT
A LITTLE JOB TO DO

01:42:59.912 --> 01:43:03.481
INSIDE THE DARK FOREST.

01:43:05.527 --> 01:43:07.137
A SORRY LOT THIS,
HAGRID.

01:43:10.401 --> 01:43:11.707
OH, GOOD GOD, MAN,
YOU'RE NOT STILL ON

01:43:11.750 --> 01:43:13.404
ABOUT THAT BLOODY
DRAGON, ARE YOU?

01:43:13.448 --> 01:43:16.973
[SNIFFLES]

01:43:17.016 --> 01:43:19.280
NORBERT'S GONE.

01:43:19.323 --> 01:43:21.717
DUMBLEDORE SENT HIM
OFF TO ROMANIA

01:43:21.760 --> 01:43:23.284
TO LIVE IN A COLONY.

01:43:23.327 --> 01:43:24.807
WELL, THAT'S GOOD,
ISN'T IT?

01:43:24.850 --> 01:43:26.330
HE'LL BE
WITH HIS OWN KIND.

01:43:26.374 --> 01:43:28.985
YEAH, BUT WHAT IF
HE DON'T LIKE ROMANIA?

01:43:29.028 --> 01:43:32.206
WHAT IF THE OTHER DRAGONS
ARE MEAN TO HIM?

01:43:32.249 --> 01:43:33.859
HE'S ONLY A BABY,
AFTER ALL.

01:43:33.903 --> 01:43:37.167
OH, FOR GOD'S SAKE,
PULL YOURSELF TOGETHER, MAN.

01:43:37.211 --> 01:43:39.822
YOU'RE GOING INTO
THE FOREST, AFTER ALL.

01:43:39.865 --> 01:43:42.346
GOT TO HAVE
YOUR WITS ABOUT YOU.

01:43:42.390 --> 01:43:45.349
THE FOREST?
I THOUGHT THAT WAS A JOKE.

01:43:45.393 --> 01:43:47.003
WE CAN'T GO IN THERE.

01:43:47.046 --> 01:43:50.224
STUDENTS AREN'T ALLOWED.

01:43:50.267 --> 01:43:51.442
AND THERE ARE--

01:43:51.486 --> 01:43:53.836
[HOWLING]

01:43:53.879 --> 01:43:55.316
WEREWOLVES!

01:43:55.359 --> 01:43:58.841
THERE'S MORE THAN WEREWOLVES
IN THOSE TREES, LAD.

01:43:58.884 --> 01:44:00.669
YOU CAN BE SURE OF THAT.

01:44:02.671 --> 01:44:05.282
NIGHTY-NIGHT.

01:44:07.850 --> 01:44:08.807
Hagrid: RIGHT.

01:44:08.851 --> 01:44:11.245
LET'S GO.

01:44:48.804 --> 01:44:51.328
HAGRID, WHAT IS THAT?

01:44:51.372 --> 01:44:54.940
WHAT WE'RE HERE FOR.
SEE THAT?

01:44:54.984 --> 01:44:57.769
THAT'S UNICORN BLOOD,
THAT IS.

01:44:57.813 --> 01:45:00.729
I FOUND ONE DEAD
A FEW WEEKS AGO.

01:45:00.772 --> 01:45:05.951
NOW, THIS ONE'S BEEN
HURT BAD BY SOMETHING.

01:45:08.737 --> 01:45:11.305
[HOWLING]

01:45:13.350 --> 01:45:17.659
SO, IT'S OUR JOB TO GO

01:45:17.702 --> 01:45:19.313
AND FIND THE POOR BEAST.

01:45:19.356 --> 01:45:21.184
RON, HERMIONE,
YOU'LL COME WITH ME.

01:45:21.227 --> 01:45:22.446
OK.

01:45:22.490 --> 01:45:24.796
AND, HARRY,
YOU'LL GO WITH MALFOY.

01:45:27.364 --> 01:45:29.366
OK, THEN I GET FANG.

01:45:29.410 --> 01:45:31.368
FINE.

01:45:31.412 --> 01:45:33.979
JUST SO'S YOU KNOW,
HE'S A BLOODY COWARD.

01:45:34.023 --> 01:45:36.939
[FANG WHINING]

01:45:39.071 --> 01:45:41.726
YOU WAIT TILL MY FATHER
HEARS ABOUT THIS.

01:45:41.770 --> 01:45:43.467
THIS IS SERVANT'S STUFF.

01:45:43.511 --> 01:45:46.601
IF I DIDN'T
KNOW BETTER, DRACO,

01:45:46.644 --> 01:45:48.516
I'D SAY
YOU WERE SCARED.

01:45:48.559 --> 01:45:50.605
SCARED, POTTER?

01:45:50.648 --> 01:45:52.346
[HOWLING]

01:45:52.389 --> 01:45:53.869
DO YOU HEAR THAT?

01:45:56.088 --> 01:45:58.352
Draco: COME ON, FANG.

01:45:58.395 --> 01:46:00.310
SCARED.

01:46:22.854 --> 01:46:24.813
[FANG GROWLING]

01:46:24.856 --> 01:46:27.685
WHAT IS IT, FANG?

01:46:31.907 --> 01:46:34.039
[GASPS]

01:46:38.217 --> 01:46:40.785
AAH!

01:46:40.829 --> 01:46:42.178
AAH! AAH!

01:46:43.614 --> 01:46:45.703
Draco: HELP!

01:46:51.579 --> 01:46:54.625
Draco: AAH!

01:47:14.297 --> 01:47:16.821
[HOOFBEATS]

01:47:37.320 --> 01:47:40.845
HARRY POTTER,
YOU MUST LEAVE.

01:47:40.889 --> 01:47:42.978
YOU ARE KNOWN
TO MANY CREATURES HERE.

01:47:43.021 --> 01:47:45.807
THE FOREST IS NOT SAFE
AT THIS TIME,

01:47:45.850 --> 01:47:47.591
ESPECIALLY FOR YOU.

01:47:47.635 --> 01:47:50.333
BUT WHAT WAS THAT THING
YOU SAVED ME FROM?

01:47:50.376 --> 01:47:52.509
A MONSTROUS CREATURE.

01:47:52.553 --> 01:47:55.773
IT IS A TERRIBLE CRIME
TO SLAY A UNICORN.

01:47:55.817 --> 01:47:57.819
DRINKING THE BLOOD
OF A UNICORN

01:47:57.862 --> 01:47:58.994
WILL KEEP YOU ALIVE,

01:47:59.037 --> 01:48:01.692
EVEN IF YOU ARE
AN INCH FROM DEATH.

01:48:01.736 --> 01:48:03.868
BUT AT A TERRIBLE PRICE.

01:48:03.912 --> 01:48:06.567
FOR YOU HAVE SLAIN
SOMETHING SO PURE

01:48:06.610 --> 01:48:09.918
THAT FROM THE MOMENT
THE BLOOD TOUCHES YOUR LIPS,

01:48:09.961 --> 01:48:12.050
YOU WILL HAVE A HALF-LIFE.

01:48:12.094 --> 01:48:14.009
A CURSED LIFE.

01:48:14.052 --> 01:48:16.098
BUT WHO WOULD CHOOSE
SUCH A LIFE?

01:48:16.141 --> 01:48:18.143
CAN YOU THINK
OF NO ONE?

01:48:18.187 --> 01:48:20.015
DO YOU MEAN TO SAY

01:48:20.058 --> 01:48:23.235
THAT THAT THING
THAT KILLED THE UNICORN,

01:48:23.279 --> 01:48:25.760
THAT WAS DRINKING
ITS BLOOD,

01:48:25.803 --> 01:48:27.457
THAT WAS VOLDEMORT?

01:48:27.501 --> 01:48:29.372
DO YOU KNOW WHAT IS HIDDEN
IN THE SCHOOL

01:48:29.415 --> 01:48:31.592
AT THIS VERY MOMENT,
MR. POTTER?

01:48:33.550 --> 01:48:35.291
THE PHILOSOPHER'S STONE.

01:48:35.334 --> 01:48:36.553
[FANG BARKING]

01:48:36.597 --> 01:48:39.077
Hermione: HARRY!

01:48:39.121 --> 01:48:40.557
HELLO THERE, FIRENZE.

01:48:40.601 --> 01:48:43.778
I SEE YOU'VE MET
OUR YOUNG MR. POTTER.

01:48:43.821 --> 01:48:44.909
YOU ALL RIGHT THERE, HARRY?

01:48:47.042 --> 01:48:48.652
HARRY POTTER,

01:48:48.696 --> 01:48:52.090
THIS IS WHERE I LEAVE YOU.

01:48:52.134 --> 01:48:54.440
YOU'RE SAFE NOW.

01:48:54.484 --> 01:48:56.312
GOOD LUCK.

01:49:03.624 --> 01:49:06.931
YOU MEAN, YOU-KNOW-WHO'S
OUT THERE, RIGHT NOW,

01:49:06.975 --> 01:49:08.193
IN THE FOREST?

01:49:08.237 --> 01:49:09.281
BUT HE'S WEAK.

01:49:09.325 --> 01:49:10.935
HE'S LIVING OFF
THE UNICORNS.

01:49:10.979 --> 01:49:13.764
DON'T YOU SEE?
WE HAD IT WRONG.

01:49:13.808 --> 01:49:16.245
SNAPE DOESN'T WANT
THE STONE FOR HIMSELF.

01:49:16.288 --> 01:49:18.813
HE WANTS THE STONE
FOR VOLDEMORT.

01:49:18.856 --> 01:49:20.031
WITH THE ELIXIR OF LIFE,

01:49:20.075 --> 01:49:21.772
VOLDEMORT WILL
BE STRONG AGAIN.

01:49:21.816 --> 01:49:23.600
HE'LL--

01:49:23.644 --> 01:49:25.384
HE'LL COME BACK.

01:49:25.428 --> 01:49:27.256
BUT IF HE COMES BACK,

01:49:27.299 --> 01:49:31.434
YOU DON'T THINK HE'LL TRY
TO KILL YOU, DO YOU?

01:49:31.477 --> 01:49:33.392
I THINK IF HE'D HAD
THE CHANCE,

01:49:33.436 --> 01:49:35.003
HE MIGHT HAVE TRIED
TO KILL ME TONIGHT.

01:49:35.046 --> 01:49:38.093
AND TO THINK
I'VE BEEN WORRYING

01:49:38.136 --> 01:49:40.008
ABOUT MY POTIONS FINAL.

01:49:40.051 --> 01:49:41.009
Hermione:
HANG ON A MINUTE.

01:49:41.052 --> 01:49:43.533
WE'RE FORGETTING
ONE THING.

01:49:43.577 --> 01:49:48.756
WHO'S THE ONE WIZARD
VOLDEMORT ALWAYS FEARED?

01:49:48.799 --> 01:49:50.888
DUMBLEDORE.

01:49:50.932 --> 01:49:52.847
AS LONG AS DUMBLEDORE'S
AROUND, HARRY,

01:49:52.890 --> 01:49:54.544
YOU'RE SAFE.

01:49:54.588 --> 01:49:56.633
AS LONG AS
DUMBLEDORE'S AROUND,

01:49:56.677 --> 01:49:58.940
YOU CAN'T BE TOUCHED.

01:50:04.162 --> 01:50:05.555
Hermione: I'D ALWAYS HEARD

01:50:05.599 --> 01:50:07.949
HOGWARTS' END-OF-YEAR EXAMS
WERE FRIGHTFUL.

01:50:07.992 --> 01:50:10.168
BUT I FOUND THAT
RATHER ENJOYABLE.

01:50:10.212 --> 01:50:11.909
SPEAK FOR YOURSELF.

01:50:11.953 --> 01:50:13.911
ALL RIGHT THERE, HARRY?

01:50:13.955 --> 01:50:18.002
MY SCAR.
IT KEEPS BURNING.

01:50:18.046 --> 01:50:19.395
IT'S HAPPENED
BEFORE.

01:50:19.438 --> 01:50:21.005
NOT LIKE THIS.

01:50:21.049 --> 01:50:22.485
Ron: PERHAPS YOU SHOULD
SEE THE NURSE?

01:50:22.528 --> 01:50:24.008
Harry: I THINK
IT'S A WARNING.

01:50:24.052 --> 01:50:25.923
IT MEANS
DANGER'S COMING.

01:50:25.967 --> 01:50:27.795
UHH!

01:50:31.189 --> 01:50:32.843
OH.

01:50:32.887 --> 01:50:35.106
OF COURSE.

01:50:35.150 --> 01:50:36.194
WHAT IS IT?

01:50:36.238 --> 01:50:37.631
DON'T YOU THINK
IT'S A BIT ODD

01:50:37.674 --> 01:50:38.936
THAT WHAT HAGRID WANTS
MORE THAN ANYTHING

01:50:38.980 --> 01:50:40.155
IS A DRAGON

01:50:40.198 --> 01:50:41.199
AND A STRANGER TURNS UP

01:50:41.243 --> 01:50:42.679
WHO JUST HAPPENS
TO HAVE ONE?

01:50:42.723 --> 01:50:44.507
I MEAN, HOW MANY
PEOPLE WANDER AROUND

01:50:44.550 --> 01:50:45.943
WITH DRAGON EGGS
IN THEIR POCKET?

01:50:45.987 --> 01:50:48.685
WHY DIDN'T
I SEE IT BEFORE?

01:50:48.729 --> 01:50:53.690
[PLAYING FLUTE]

01:50:53.734 --> 01:50:56.345
HAGRID, WHO GAVE YOU
THE DRAGON EGG?

01:50:56.388 --> 01:50:57.520
WHAT DID HE LOOK LIKE?

01:50:57.563 --> 01:50:59.740
I DON'T KNOW.
I NEVER SAW HIS FACE.

01:50:59.783 --> 01:51:00.741
HE KEPT HIS HOOD UP.

01:51:00.784 --> 01:51:01.785
THIS STRANGER, THOUGH,

01:51:01.829 --> 01:51:03.482
YOU AND HE MUST HAVE TALKED.

01:51:03.526 --> 01:51:05.702
WELL, HE WANTED TO KNOW

01:51:05.746 --> 01:51:07.704
WHAT SORT OF CREATURES
I LOOKED AFTER.

01:51:07.748 --> 01:51:10.098
I TOLD HIM. I SAID,
"AFTER FLUFFY,

01:51:10.141 --> 01:51:11.926
A DRAGON'S GONNA BE
NO PROBLEM."

01:51:11.969 --> 01:51:13.536
DID HE SEEM
INTERESTED IN FLUFFY?

01:51:13.579 --> 01:51:16.539
WELL, OF COURSE HE WAS
INTERESTED IN FLUFFY.

01:51:16.582 --> 01:51:18.933
HOW OFTEN TO YOU COME
ACROSS A 3-HEADED DOG,

01:51:18.976 --> 01:51:20.761
EVEN IF YOU'RE
IN THE TRADE?

01:51:20.804 --> 01:51:23.024
BUT I TOLD HIM,
I SAID--

01:51:23.067 --> 01:51:24.982
I SAID, "THE TRICK
WITH ANY BEAST

01:51:25.026 --> 01:51:26.114
IS TO KNOW
HOW TO CALM HIM."

01:51:26.157 --> 01:51:28.769
TAKE FLUFFY,
FOR EXAMPLE.

01:51:28.812 --> 01:51:29.857
JUST PLAY HIM
A BIT OF MUSIC,

01:51:29.900 --> 01:51:31.423
AND HE FALLS
STRAIGHT TO SLEEP.

01:51:33.599 --> 01:51:35.558
I SHOULDN'T HAVE
TOLD YOU THAT.

01:51:36.994 --> 01:51:39.431
WHERE YOU GOING? WAIT!

01:51:46.264 --> 01:51:47.744
WE HAVE TO SEE
PROFESSOR DUMBLEDORE,

01:51:47.788 --> 01:51:49.093
IMMEDIATELY!

01:51:49.137 --> 01:51:51.617
I'M AFRAID PROFESSOR
DUMBLEDORE IS NOT HERE.

01:51:51.661 --> 01:51:55.447
HE RECEIVED AN URGENT OWL
FROM THE MINISTRY OF MAGIC

01:51:55.491 --> 01:51:56.666
AND LEFT IMMEDIATELY
FOR LONDON.

01:51:56.710 --> 01:51:59.974
HE'S GONE? NOW?
BUT THIS IS IMPORTANT!

01:52:00.017 --> 01:52:02.237
THIS IS ABOUT
THE PHILOSOPHER'S STONE.

01:52:02.280 --> 01:52:04.587
HOW DO YOU KNOW--

01:52:04.630 --> 01:52:06.502
SOMEONE'S GOING
TO TRY AND STEAL IT.

01:52:08.112 --> 01:52:09.940
I DON'T KNOW HOW YOU THREE
FOUND OUT ABOUT THE STONE,

01:52:09.984 --> 01:52:12.769
BUT I ASSURE YOU, IT IS
PERFECTLY WELL-PROTECTED.

01:52:12.813 --> 01:52:15.946
NOW WOULD YOU GO BACK
TO YOUR DORMITORIES?

01:52:15.990 --> 01:52:17.165
QUIETLY.

01:52:26.130 --> 01:52:28.567
THAT WAS NO STRANGER
HAGRID MET IN THE VILLAGE.

01:52:28.611 --> 01:52:31.048
IT WAS SNAPE,
WHICH MEANS HE KNOWS

01:52:31.092 --> 01:52:32.093
HOW TO GET PAST FLUFFY.

01:52:32.136 --> 01:52:33.790
AND WITH
DUMBLEDORE GONE--

01:52:33.834 --> 01:52:35.879
GOOD AFTERNOON.

01:52:37.620 --> 01:52:40.362
NOW WHAT WOULD
THREE YOUNG GRYFFINDORS

01:52:40.405 --> 01:52:41.537
SUCH AS YOURSELVES

01:52:41.580 --> 01:52:46.498
BE DOING INSIDE
ON A DAY LIKE THIS?

01:52:46.542 --> 01:52:49.066
UH--

01:52:50.546 --> 01:52:52.156
WE--
WE WERE JUST--

01:52:52.200 --> 01:52:54.289
YOU WANT TO BE CAREFUL.

01:52:54.332 --> 01:52:56.726
PEOPLE WILL THINK
YOU'RE...

01:53:00.686 --> 01:53:02.776
UP TO SOMETHING.

01:53:13.874 --> 01:53:14.875
NOW WHAT DO WE DO?

01:53:14.918 --> 01:53:18.008
WE GO DOWN THE TRAP DOOR.

01:53:18.052 --> 01:53:20.097
TONIGHT.

01:53:31.413 --> 01:53:33.371
[CROAKING]

01:53:33.415 --> 01:53:36.070
TREVOR.

01:53:36.113 --> 01:53:37.506
TREVOR, SHH, GO!
YOU SHOULDN'T BE HERE.

01:53:37.549 --> 01:53:39.421
[CROAKING]

01:53:39.464 --> 01:53:40.552
NEITHER SHOULD YOU.

01:53:42.380 --> 01:53:44.513
YOU'RE SNEAKING OUT
AGAIN, AREN'T YOU?

01:53:44.556 --> 01:53:46.732
NOW, NEVILLE, LISTEN.
WE WERE--

01:53:46.776 --> 01:53:48.865
NO! I WON'T LET YOU.

01:53:48.909 --> 01:53:51.172
YOU'LL GET GRYFFINDOR
INTO TROUBLE AGAIN.

01:53:51.215 --> 01:53:53.261
I-I'LL FIGHT YOU.

01:53:53.304 --> 01:53:54.436
NEVILLE,

01:53:54.479 --> 01:53:55.741
I'M REALLY, REALLY
SORRY ABOUT THIS.

01:53:55.785 --> 01:53:58.135
PETRIFUCUS TOTALUS.

01:54:05.926 --> 01:54:08.450
YOU'RE A LITTLE SCARY
SOMETIMES,

01:54:08.493 --> 01:54:09.799
YOU KNOW THAT?

01:54:09.843 --> 01:54:13.716
BRILLIANT BUT SCARY.

01:54:13.759 --> 01:54:15.283
LET'S GO.

01:54:15.326 --> 01:54:16.937
Harry: SORRY.

01:54:16.980 --> 01:54:18.155
Hermione: SORRY.

01:54:18.199 --> 01:54:20.549
Ron: IT'S FOR
YOUR OWN GOOD, YOU KNOW.

01:54:25.554 --> 01:54:28.122
OW! YOU STOOD ON MY FOOT!

01:54:28.165 --> 01:54:29.863
SORRY.

01:54:33.954 --> 01:54:35.869
Hermione: ALOHOMORA.

01:54:38.741 --> 01:54:40.874
[HARP PLAYING]

01:54:40.917 --> 01:54:43.877
[SNORING]

01:54:47.402 --> 01:54:51.536
WAIT A MINUTE, HE'S...

01:54:51.580 --> 01:54:53.147
SNORING.

01:54:53.190 --> 01:54:56.106
[HARP PLAYING]

01:54:56.150 --> 01:54:59.370
Harry: SNAPE'S
ALREADY BEEN HERE.

01:54:59.414 --> 01:55:02.330
HE'S PUT A SPELL
ON THE HARP.

01:55:02.373 --> 01:55:05.855
UHH! IT'S GOT
HORRIBLE BREATH.

01:55:08.771 --> 01:55:10.729
Harry: WE HAVE
TO MOVE ITS PAW.

01:55:10.773 --> 01:55:12.818
WHAT?
COME ON!

01:55:17.040 --> 01:55:19.390
OK, PUSH.

01:55:25.005 --> 01:55:26.702
[SNORTS]

01:55:41.717 --> 01:55:43.545
I'LL GO FIRST.

01:55:43.588 --> 01:55:45.068
DON'T FOLLOW UNTIL
I GIVE YOU A SIGN.

01:55:45.112 --> 01:55:47.766
IF SOMETHING
BAD HAPPENS,

01:55:47.810 --> 01:55:50.291
GET YOURSELVES OUT.

01:55:52.206 --> 01:55:55.513
DOES IT SEEM
A BIT QUIET TO YOU?

01:55:55.557 --> 01:55:58.560
THE HARP.

01:55:58.603 --> 01:55:59.909
IT STOPPED PLAYING.

01:56:02.694 --> 01:56:05.871
UGH! YUCK!

01:56:05.915 --> 01:56:07.308
UGH.

01:56:11.312 --> 01:56:12.748
Harry: JUMP!

01:56:13.836 --> 01:56:15.969
GO!

01:56:18.145 --> 01:56:19.973
AAH!

01:56:20.016 --> 01:56:22.671
AAH!

01:56:22.714 --> 01:56:24.803
[GASPS]

01:56:24.847 --> 01:56:26.109
WHOA.

01:56:26.153 --> 01:56:29.460
LUCKY THIS PLANT-THING
IS HERE, REALLY.

01:56:29.504 --> 01:56:31.332
WHOA!

01:56:36.163 --> 01:56:37.512
OH! AAH!

01:56:44.867 --> 01:56:46.738
Hermione: STOP MOVING,
BOTH OF YOU.

01:56:46.782 --> 01:56:48.088
THIS IS DEVIL'S SNARE.

01:56:48.131 --> 01:56:49.480
YOU HAVE TO RELAX.

01:56:49.524 --> 01:56:52.179
IF YOU DON'T,
IT'LL ONLY KILL YOU FASTER.

01:56:52.222 --> 01:56:54.007
KILL US FASTER?

01:56:54.050 --> 01:56:55.530
OH, NOW I CAN RELAX!

01:56:59.142 --> 01:57:00.665
HERMIONE!
HERMIONE!

01:57:00.709 --> 01:57:02.798
NOW WHAT ARE
WE GONNA DO?!

01:57:02.841 --> 01:57:05.105
Hermione:
JUST RELAX!

01:57:05.148 --> 01:57:06.628
HERMIONE, WHERE ARE YOU?

01:57:06.671 --> 01:57:09.761
DO WHAT I SAY!
TRUST ME.

01:57:11.850 --> 01:57:14.288
AAH! HARRY!

01:57:14.331 --> 01:57:16.420
Ron: HARRY!
OOF!

01:57:16.464 --> 01:57:17.639
ARE YOU OK?

01:57:17.682 --> 01:57:19.162
YEAH. YEAH, I'M FINE.

01:57:19.206 --> 01:57:20.294
Ron: HELP!

01:57:20.337 --> 01:57:22.078
HE'S NOT RELAXING,
IS HE?

01:57:22.122 --> 01:57:23.688
APPARENTLY NOT.

01:57:23.732 --> 01:57:24.689
WE'VE GOT TO DO
SOMETHING.

01:57:24.733 --> 01:57:26.256
WHAT?

01:57:26.300 --> 01:57:28.389
I REMEMBER READING
SOMETHING IN HERBOLOGY.

01:57:28.432 --> 01:57:29.390
UM--

01:57:29.433 --> 01:57:30.652
HELP!

01:57:30.695 --> 01:57:31.827
Hermione: DEVIL'S SNARE,
DEVIL'S SNARE,

01:57:31.870 --> 01:57:34.090
IT'S DEADLY FUN,

01:57:34.134 --> 01:57:36.223
BUT WILL SULK IN THE SUN.
THAT'S IT!

01:57:36.266 --> 01:57:38.703
DEVIL'S SNARE
HATES SUNLIGHT.

01:57:38.747 --> 01:57:41.445
LUMUS SOLEM.

01:57:41.489 --> 01:57:44.622
[SHRIEKING]

01:57:44.666 --> 01:57:47.103
AAH!

01:57:48.452 --> 01:57:50.106
RON, YOU OK?

01:57:50.150 --> 01:57:52.456
YEAH.
OK.

01:57:52.500 --> 01:57:53.457
WHEW!

01:57:53.501 --> 01:57:57.331
LUCKY WE DIDN'T PANIC.

01:57:57.374 --> 01:58:00.508
LUCKY HERMIONE PAYS
ATTENTION IN HERBOLOGY.

01:58:02.466 --> 01:58:04.033
WHAT IS THAT?

01:58:04.077 --> 01:58:06.166
I DON'T KNOW.

01:58:06.209 --> 01:58:08.168
SOUNDS LIKE WINGS.

01:58:08.211 --> 01:58:10.431
[FLUTTERING]

01:58:20.789 --> 01:58:21.877
CURIOUS.

01:58:21.920 --> 01:58:24.967
I'VE NEVER SEEN
BIRDS LIKE THESE.

01:58:25.010 --> 01:58:27.361
Harry: THEY'RE NOT BIRDS,
THEY'RE KEYS.

01:58:27.404 --> 01:58:30.973
AND I'LL BET ONE OF THEM
FITS THAT DOOR.

01:58:35.151 --> 01:58:36.718
WHAT'S THIS ALL ABOUT?

01:58:36.761 --> 01:58:39.242
I DON'T KNOW.

01:58:45.857 --> 01:58:47.468
STRANGE.

01:58:47.511 --> 01:58:48.469
[LOCK RATTLING]

01:58:48.512 --> 01:58:51.472
Ron: ALOHOMORA.

01:58:53.778 --> 01:58:55.519
WELL, IT WAS
WORTH A TRY.

01:58:55.563 --> 01:58:57.695
UHH! WHAT ARE
WE GOING TO DO?

01:58:57.739 --> 01:58:59.697
THERE MUST BE
1,000 KEYS UP THERE.

01:58:59.741 --> 01:59:01.917
Ron: WE'RE LOOKING FOR
A BIG, OLD-FASHIONED ONE.

01:59:01.960 --> 01:59:03.179
PROBABLY RUSTY,
LIKE THE HANDLE.

01:59:03.223 --> 01:59:05.181
THERE! I SEE IT!

01:59:05.225 --> 01:59:07.227
THE ONE WITH
THE BROKEN WING.

01:59:09.620 --> 01:59:11.927
WHAT'S WRONG, HARRY?

01:59:14.190 --> 01:59:15.539
IT'S TOO SIMPLE.

01:59:15.583 --> 01:59:17.454
OH, GO ON, HARRY!

01:59:17.498 --> 01:59:19.326
IF SNAPE COULD CATCH IT
ON THAT OLD BROOMSTICK,

01:59:19.369 --> 01:59:20.588
YOU CAN.

01:59:20.631 --> 01:59:23.199
YOU'RE THE YOUNGEST
SEEKER IN A CENTURY.

01:59:30.728 --> 01:59:33.035
[FLUTTERING]

01:59:41.086 --> 01:59:43.219
THIS COMPLICATES
THINGS A BIT.

02:00:05.285 --> 02:00:06.547
Harry: CATCH THE KEY!

02:00:11.421 --> 02:00:12.422
HURRY UP!

02:00:46.108 --> 02:00:47.414
I DON'T LIKE THIS.

02:00:47.457 --> 02:00:50.895
Hermione: I DON'T
LIKE THIS AT ALL.

02:00:50.939 --> 02:00:52.549
WHERE ARE WE?

02:00:52.593 --> 02:00:54.290
A GRAVEYARD.

02:00:54.334 --> 02:00:58.251
THIS IS NO GRAVEYARD.
[SIGHS]

02:01:04.474 --> 02:01:06.302
IT'S A CHESSBOARD.

02:01:18.793 --> 02:01:20.273
THERE'S THE DOOR.

02:01:32.546 --> 02:01:35.244
NOW WHAT DO WE DO?

02:01:35.288 --> 02:01:36.550
IT'S OBVIOUS, ISN'T IT?

02:01:36.593 --> 02:01:39.727
WE GOT TO PLAY OUR WAY
ACROSS THE ROOM.

02:01:39.770 --> 02:01:41.859
ALL RIGHT, HARRY,

02:01:41.903 --> 02:01:44.035
YOU TAKE THE EMPTY
BISHOP'S SQUARE.

02:01:44.079 --> 02:01:46.342
HERMIONE, YOU'LL BE

02:01:46.386 --> 02:01:48.562
THE QUEEN'S
SIDE CASTLE.

02:01:48.605 --> 02:01:50.215
AS FOR ME,

02:01:50.259 --> 02:01:52.870
I'LL BE A KNIGHT.

02:01:59.660 --> 02:02:01.792
WHAT HAPPENS NOW?

02:02:01.836 --> 02:02:05.535
WELL, WHITE MOVES FIRST.

02:02:05.579 --> 02:02:09.060
AND THEN...

02:02:09.104 --> 02:02:10.671
WE PLAY.

02:02:21.029 --> 02:02:22.509
RON,

02:02:22.552 --> 02:02:26.251
YOU DON'T SUPPOSE THIS
IS GOING TO BE LIKE...

02:02:26.295 --> 02:02:30.168
REAL WIZARD'S CHESS,
DO YOU?

02:02:30.212 --> 02:02:32.693
YOU THERE, D-5.

02:02:47.882 --> 02:02:49.666
YES, HERMIONE.

02:02:49.710 --> 02:02:54.889
I THINK THIS IS GONNA BE
EXACTLY LIKE WIZARD CHESS.

02:03:00.373 --> 02:03:02.549
CASTLE TO E-4!

02:03:06.596 --> 02:03:09.207
PAWN TO C-3!

02:03:53.774 --> 02:03:54.862
WAIT A MINUTE.

02:03:56.037 --> 02:03:57.908
YOU UNDERSTAND
RIGHT, HARRY.

02:03:57.952 --> 02:04:00.433
ONCE I MAKE MY MOVE,

02:04:00.476 --> 02:04:03.044
THE QUEEN
WILL TAKE ME.

02:04:03.087 --> 02:04:06.003
THEN YOU'RE FREE
TO CHECK THE KING.

02:04:06.047 --> 02:04:07.701
NO. RON, NO!

02:04:07.744 --> 02:04:08.832
WHAT IS IT?

02:04:08.876 --> 02:04:10.791
HE'S GOING TO
SACRIFICE HIMSELF.

02:04:10.834 --> 02:04:11.879
NO, YOU CAN'T!

02:04:11.922 --> 02:04:13.968
THERE MUST BE
ANOTHER WAY!

02:04:14.011 --> 02:04:15.186
DO YOU WANT
TO STOP SNAPE

02:04:15.230 --> 02:04:17.711
FROM GETTING
THAT STONE OR NOT?

02:04:17.754 --> 02:04:20.235
HARRY, IT'S YOU
THAT HAS TO GO ON.

02:04:20.278 --> 02:04:21.715
I KNOW IT.

02:04:21.758 --> 02:04:23.847
NOT ME, NOT HERMIONE.

02:04:23.891 --> 02:04:25.022
YOU.

02:04:34.989 --> 02:04:37.470
KNIGHT TO H-3.

02:04:58.795 --> 02:05:01.363
CHECK.

02:05:24.125 --> 02:05:25.822
AAH!

02:05:30.131 --> 02:05:32.176
RON!

02:05:32.220 --> 02:05:34.135
NO! DON'T MOVE!

02:05:34.178 --> 02:05:37.181
DON'T FORGET,
WE'RE STILL PLAYING.

02:05:52.893 --> 02:05:54.503
CHECKMATE.

02:06:14.044 --> 02:06:15.698
TAKE CARE OF RON.

02:06:15.742 --> 02:06:17.091
THEN
GO TO THE OWLERY.

02:06:17.134 --> 02:06:19.223
SEND A MESSAGE
TO DUMBLEDORE.

02:06:19.267 --> 02:06:20.921
RON'S RIGHT.

02:06:20.964 --> 02:06:23.010
I HAVE TO GO ON.

02:06:23.053 --> 02:06:25.578
YOU'LL BE OK, HARRY.

02:06:25.621 --> 02:06:27.101
YOU'RE A GREAT WIZARD.

02:06:27.144 --> 02:06:29.364
YOU REALLY ARE.

02:06:29.407 --> 02:06:31.714
NOT AS GOOD AS YOU.

02:06:31.758 --> 02:06:33.716
HEH. ME?

02:06:33.760 --> 02:06:35.718
BOOKS AND CLEVERNESS.

02:06:35.762 --> 02:06:37.807
THERE ARE MORE
IMPORTANT THINGS.

02:06:39.026 --> 02:06:42.159
FRIENDSHIP AND BRAVERY.

02:06:42.203 --> 02:06:44.684
AND, HARRY,
JUST BE CAREFUL.

02:07:22.156 --> 02:07:23.418
YOU?

02:07:24.724 --> 02:07:27.465
NO, IT CAN'T BE.

02:07:27.509 --> 02:07:29.163
SNAPE--HE WAS THE ONE--

02:07:29.206 --> 02:07:32.427
YES, HE DOES SEEM
THE TYPE, DOESN'T HE?

02:07:32.470 --> 02:07:34.472
NEXT TO HIM,
WHO WOULD SUSPECT

02:07:34.516 --> 02:07:38.825
P-P-POOR, ST-T-TUTTERING
PROFESSOR QUIRRELL?

02:07:38.868 --> 02:07:41.262
BUT--BUT THAT DAY,

02:07:41.305 --> 02:07:43.481
DURING THE QUIDDITCH MATCH,

02:07:43.525 --> 02:07:44.787
SNAPE TRIED TO KILL ME.

02:07:44.831 --> 02:07:46.702
NO, DEAR BOY.

02:07:46.746 --> 02:07:48.486
I TRIED TO KILL YOU,

02:07:48.530 --> 02:07:50.010
AND TRUST ME,

02:07:50.053 --> 02:07:51.533
IF SNAPE'S CLOAK
HADN'T CAUGHT FIRE

02:07:51.576 --> 02:07:53.187
AND BROKEN
MY EYE CONTACT,

02:07:53.230 --> 02:07:55.493
I WOULD HAVE SUCCEEDED.

02:07:55.537 --> 02:07:56.625
EVEN WITH SNAPE

02:07:56.669 --> 02:07:58.714
MUTTERING HIS LITTLE
COUNTER-CURSE.

02:07:58.758 --> 02:08:01.195
SNAPE WAS TRYING
TO SAVE ME?

02:08:01.238 --> 02:08:03.676
I KNEW YOU WERE A DANGER
TO ME RIGHT FROM THE OFF,

02:08:03.719 --> 02:08:05.590
ESPECIALLY AFTER HALLOWEEN.

02:08:05.634 --> 02:08:08.811
TH-THEN YOU LET
THE TROLL IN.

02:08:08.855 --> 02:08:11.161
VERY GOOD, POTTER. YES.

02:08:11.205 --> 02:08:14.382
SNAPE, UNFORTUNATELY,
WASN'T FOOLED.

02:08:14.425 --> 02:08:16.427
WHILE EVERYONE ELSE WAS
RUNNING ABOUT THE DUNGEON,

02:08:16.471 --> 02:08:18.778
HE WENT TO THE THIRD FLOOR
TO HEAD ME OFF.

02:08:20.518 --> 02:08:22.085
HE, OF COURSE,

02:08:22.129 --> 02:08:24.348
NEVER TRUSTED ME AGAIN.

02:08:24.392 --> 02:08:27.743
HE RARELY LEFT ME ALONE.

02:08:27.787 --> 02:08:30.528
BUT HE DOESN'T
UNDERSTAND.

02:08:30.572 --> 02:08:32.661
I'M NEVER ALONE.

02:08:32.705 --> 02:08:34.750
NEVER.

02:08:34.794 --> 02:08:36.491
NOW...

02:08:36.534 --> 02:08:38.449
WHAT DOES THIS MIRROR DO?

02:08:40.582 --> 02:08:42.802
I SEE WHAT I DESIRE.

02:08:42.845 --> 02:08:46.109
I SEE MYSELF
HOLDING THE STONE.

02:08:46.153 --> 02:08:48.590
BUT HOW DO I GET IT?

02:08:48.633 --> 02:08:50.113
[WHISPERING]
Use the boy.

02:08:50.157 --> 02:08:53.029
COME HERE, POTTER!

02:08:53.073 --> 02:08:54.639
NOW!

02:09:06.608 --> 02:09:07.957
TELL ME.

02:09:08.001 --> 02:09:09.829
WHAT DO YOU SEE?

02:09:35.855 --> 02:09:37.944
WHAT IS IT?
WHAT DO YOU SEE?

02:09:37.987 --> 02:09:42.078
I-I'M SHAKING HANDS
WITH DUMBLEDORE.

02:09:42.122 --> 02:09:44.037
I'VE WON THE HOUSE CUP.

02:09:44.080 --> 02:09:45.690
HE LIES.

02:09:45.734 --> 02:09:47.823
TELL THE TRUTH!

02:09:47.867 --> 02:09:49.825
WHAT DO YOU SEE?!

02:09:49.869 --> 02:09:52.741
LET ME SPEAK TO HIM.

02:09:52.785 --> 02:09:54.351
MASTER, YOU ARE NOT
STRONG ENOUGH.

02:09:54.395 --> 02:09:57.790
I HAVE STRENGTH
ENOUGH FOR THIS.

02:10:16.547 --> 02:10:19.420
HARRY POTTER,

02:10:19.463 --> 02:10:22.205
WE MEET AGAIN.

02:10:22.249 --> 02:10:23.903
VOLDEMORT?

02:10:23.946 --> 02:10:25.469
YES.

02:10:25.513 --> 02:10:28.081
YOU SEE
WHAT I'VE BECOME?

02:10:28.124 --> 02:10:31.998
SEE WHAT I MUST DO
TO SURVIVE?

02:10:32.041 --> 02:10:34.087
LIVE OFF ANOTHER.

02:10:34.130 --> 02:10:36.219
A MERE PARASITE.

02:10:36.263 --> 02:10:40.180
UNICORN BLOOD
CAN SUSTAIN ME,

02:10:40.223 --> 02:10:44.140
BUT IT CANNOT GIVE ME
A BODY OF MY OWN,

02:10:44.184 --> 02:10:47.056
BUT THERE IS
SOMETHING THAT CAN.

02:10:47.100 --> 02:10:50.799
SOMETHING THAT,
CONVENIENTLY ENOUGH,

02:10:50.843 --> 02:10:53.802
LIES IN YOUR POCKET.

02:10:53.846 --> 02:10:55.760
STOP HIM!

02:11:00.069 --> 02:11:03.899
DON'T BE A FOOL.

02:11:03.943 --> 02:11:06.510
WHY SUFFER
A HORRIFIC DEATH

02:11:06.554 --> 02:11:10.950
WHEN YOU CAN JOIN ME
AND LIVE?

02:11:10.993 --> 02:11:12.299
NEVER!

02:11:12.342 --> 02:11:16.259
[LAUGHS] BRAVERY.

02:11:16.303 --> 02:11:19.523
YOUR PARENTS
HAD IT, TOO.

02:11:19.567 --> 02:11:23.136
TELL ME, HARRY,

02:11:23.179 --> 02:11:24.615
WOULD YOU LIKE
TO SEE

02:11:24.659 --> 02:11:27.270
YOUR MOTHER
AND FATHER AGAIN?

02:11:27.314 --> 02:11:32.362
TOGETHER, WE CAN
BRING THEM BACK.

02:11:32.406 --> 02:11:34.103
ALL I ASK

02:11:34.147 --> 02:11:36.540
IS FOR SOMETHING
IN RETURN.

02:11:43.896 --> 02:11:48.030
THAT'S IT, HARRY.

02:11:48.074 --> 02:11:52.121
THERE IS NO
GOOD AND EVIL.

02:11:52.165 --> 02:11:55.385
THERE IS ONLY POWER

02:11:55.429 --> 02:11:58.998
AND THOSE TOO WEAK
TO SEEK IT.

02:12:00.173 --> 02:12:05.395
TOGETHER, WE'LL DO
EXTRAORDINARY THINGS.

02:12:05.439 --> 02:12:08.094
JUST GIVE ME THE STONE!

02:12:10.444 --> 02:12:11.924
YOU LIAR!

02:12:11.967 --> 02:12:13.186
KILL HIM!

02:12:29.376 --> 02:12:30.812
AAH!

02:12:30.855 --> 02:12:35.556
AAAAAAAHHHH!

02:12:37.558 --> 02:12:39.212
WHAT IS THIS MAGIC?!

02:12:39.255 --> 02:12:41.605
FOOL!
GET THE STONE!

02:12:48.003 --> 02:12:52.355
AAAAAAAH!

02:13:38.880 --> 02:13:40.838
AAAAAHHHH!

02:13:40.882 --> 02:13:43.580
AAAHHHHH!

02:14:28.147 --> 02:14:31.019
GOOD AFTERNOON, HARRY.

02:14:31.063 --> 02:14:32.455
AH.

02:14:32.499 --> 02:14:35.067
TOKENS FROM
YOUR ADMIRERS?

02:14:35.110 --> 02:14:37.373
ADMIRERS?

02:14:37.417 --> 02:14:39.114
WHAT HAPPENED
DOWN IN THE DUNGEONS

02:14:39.158 --> 02:14:41.377
BETWEEN YOU
AND PROFESSOR QUIRRELL

02:14:41.421 --> 02:14:43.510
IS A COMPLETE SECRET.

02:14:43.553 --> 02:14:47.296
SO, NATURALLY,
THE WHOLE SCHOOL KNOWS.

02:14:50.778 --> 02:14:51.909
AH,

02:14:51.953 --> 02:14:53.259
I SEE THAT
YOUR FRIEND RONALD

02:14:53.302 --> 02:14:54.782
HAS SAVED YOU THE TROUBLE

02:14:54.825 --> 02:14:57.654
OF OPENING
YOUR CHOCOLATE FROGS.

02:14:57.698 --> 02:14:58.829
RON WAS HERE?

02:14:58.873 --> 02:15:00.701
IS HE ALL RIGHT?
WHAT ABOUT HERMIONE?

02:15:00.744 --> 02:15:02.790
FINE.

02:15:02.833 --> 02:15:06.272
THEY'RE BOTH JUST FINE.

02:15:06.315 --> 02:15:07.708
BUT WHAT HAPPENED
TO THE STONE?

02:15:07.751 --> 02:15:09.405
RELAX, DEAR BOY.

02:15:09.449 --> 02:15:12.800
THE STONE
HAS BEEN DESTROYED.

02:15:12.843 --> 02:15:15.803
MY FRIEND NICHOLAS AND I
HAVE HAD A LITTLE CHAT

02:15:15.846 --> 02:15:18.632
AND AGREED IT WAS BEST

02:15:18.675 --> 02:15:21.025
ALL AROUND.

02:15:21.069 --> 02:15:22.462
BUT THEN, FLAMEL...

02:15:22.505 --> 02:15:24.290
HE'LL DIE, WON'T HE?

02:15:26.857 --> 02:15:28.642
HE HAS ENOUGH ELIXIR

02:15:28.685 --> 02:15:31.645
TO SET HIS AFFAIRS
IN ORDER,

02:15:31.688 --> 02:15:36.215
BUT, YES, HE WILL DIE.

02:15:36.258 --> 02:15:38.478
HOW IS IT
I GOT THE STONE, SIR?

02:15:38.521 --> 02:15:40.175
ONE MINUTE, I WAS
STARING IN THE MIRROR,

02:15:40.219 --> 02:15:41.263
AND THE NEXT--

02:15:41.307 --> 02:15:45.572
AH. YOU SEE,
ONLY A PERSON

02:15:45.615 --> 02:15:47.922
WHO WANTED TO FIND
THE STONE--

02:15:47.965 --> 02:15:52.405
FIND IT,
BUT NOT USE IT--

02:15:52.448 --> 02:15:55.408
WOULD BE ABLE TO GET IT.

02:15:55.451 --> 02:15:59.063
THAT IS ONE OF MY
MORE BRILLIANT IDEAS,

02:15:59.107 --> 02:16:03.155
AND BETWEEN YOU AND ME,
THAT IS SAYING SOMETHING.

02:16:05.592 --> 02:16:07.115
DOES THAT MEAN,

02:16:07.159 --> 02:16:08.986
WITH THE STONE GONE,
THAT IS,

02:16:09.030 --> 02:16:11.163
THAT VOLDEMORT
CAN NEVER COME BACK?

02:16:11.206 --> 02:16:14.862
AH, I'M AFRAID...

02:16:14.905 --> 02:16:19.214
THERE ARE WAYS
IN WHICH HE CAN RETURN.

02:16:19.258 --> 02:16:23.697
HARRY, DO YOU KNOW
WHY PROFESSOR QUIRRELL

02:16:23.740 --> 02:16:26.613
COULDN'T BEAR TO HAVE
YOU TOUCH HIM?

02:16:26.656 --> 02:16:29.006
IT WAS BECAUSE
OF YOUR MOTHER.

02:16:29.050 --> 02:16:31.661
SHE SACRIFICED
HERSELF FOR YOU,

02:16:31.705 --> 02:16:34.621
AND THAT KIND OF ACT
LEAVES A MARK.

02:16:34.664 --> 02:16:36.536
NO, NO.

02:16:36.579 --> 02:16:39.278
THIS KIND OF MARK
CAN NOT BE SEEN.

02:16:39.321 --> 02:16:42.281
IT LIVES
IN YOUR VERY SKIN.

02:16:42.324 --> 02:16:44.500
WHAT IS IT?

02:16:44.544 --> 02:16:47.416
LOVE, HARRY.

02:16:47.460 --> 02:16:49.026
LOVE.

02:16:55.729 --> 02:16:56.817
AH.

02:16:56.860 --> 02:17:01.125
BERTIE BOTT'S
EVERY FLAVOR BEANS.

02:17:01.169 --> 02:17:03.258
I WAS MOST UNFORTUNATE
IN MY YOUTH

02:17:03.302 --> 02:17:06.130
TO COME ACROSS
A VOMIT-FLAVORED ONE,

02:17:06.174 --> 02:17:09.438
AND SINCE THEN, I'M AFRAID,
I'VE LOST MY LIKING FOR THEM.

02:17:09.482 --> 02:17:12.615
BUT I THINK
I COULD BE SAFE

02:17:12.659 --> 02:17:14.704
WITH A NICE TOFFEE.

02:17:18.317 --> 02:17:19.579
MMM.

02:17:19.622 --> 02:17:21.668
ALAS.

02:17:21.711 --> 02:17:23.017
EAR WAX.

02:17:38.902 --> 02:17:40.730
ALL RIGHT THERE, RON?

02:17:40.774 --> 02:17:42.819
ALL RIGHT. YOU?

02:17:42.863 --> 02:17:45.213
ALL RIGHT.

02:17:45.257 --> 02:17:46.606
HERMIONE?

02:17:46.649 --> 02:17:49.173
NEVER BETTER.

02:17:56.746 --> 02:17:58.705
[DINGING]

02:18:04.537 --> 02:18:07.409
ANOTHER YEAR GONE.

02:18:07.453 --> 02:18:10.194
AND NOW,
AS I UNDERSTAND IT,

02:18:10.238 --> 02:18:12.806
THE HOUSE CUP
NEEDS AWARDING,

02:18:12.849 --> 02:18:15.635
AND THE POINTS
STAND THUS--

02:18:15.678 --> 02:18:17.245
IN FOURTH PLACE,

02:18:17.289 --> 02:18:20.074
GRYFFINDOR,
WITH 312 POINTS.

02:18:20.117 --> 02:18:23.295
[APPLAUSE]

02:18:23.338 --> 02:18:25.122
THIRD PLACE,

02:18:25.166 --> 02:18:26.863
HUFFLEPUFF,

02:18:26.907 --> 02:18:29.126
WITH 352 POINTS.

02:18:34.131 --> 02:18:37.918
IN SECOND PLACE,
RAVENCLAW...

02:18:37.961 --> 02:18:41.225
WITH 426 POINTS.

02:18:46.709 --> 02:18:48.581
AND IN FIRST PLACE,

02:18:48.624 --> 02:18:51.497
WITH 472 POINTS,

02:18:51.540 --> 02:18:52.585
SLYTHERIN HOUSE.

02:18:52.628 --> 02:18:55.544
YEAH!
WHOO!

02:18:59.679 --> 02:19:02.159
NICE ONE, MATE.

02:19:05.946 --> 02:19:07.774
YES, YES.
WELL DONE, SLYTHERIN.

02:19:07.817 --> 02:19:09.253
WELL DONE, SLYTHERIN.

02:19:09.297 --> 02:19:14.694
HOWEVER, RECENT EVENTS
MUST BE TAKEN INTO ACCOUNT,

02:19:14.737 --> 02:19:20.352
AND I HAVE A FEW LAST-MINUTE
POINTS TO AWARD.

02:19:20.395 --> 02:19:23.267
TO MISS HERMIONE GRANGER,

02:19:23.311 --> 02:19:26.662
FOR THE COOL USE
OF INTELLECT

02:19:26.706 --> 02:19:29.012
WHEN OTHERS
WERE IN GRAVE PERIL,

02:19:29.056 --> 02:19:30.884
50 POINTS.

02:19:32.755 --> 02:19:34.191
GOOD JOB.

02:19:41.721 --> 02:19:45.115
SECOND,
TO MR. RONALD WEASLEY,

02:19:45.159 --> 02:19:47.944
FOR THE BEST-PLAYED
GAME OF CHESS

02:19:47.988 --> 02:19:52.253
THAT HOGWARTS HAS SEEN
THESE MANY YEARS,

02:19:52.296 --> 02:19:53.689
50 POINTS.

02:19:58.041 --> 02:20:00.653
AND THIRD,

02:20:00.696 --> 02:20:02.916
TO MR. HARRY POTTER,

02:20:02.959 --> 02:20:08.225
FOR PURE NERVE
AND OUTSTANDING COURAGE,

02:20:08.269 --> 02:20:12.099
I AWARD GRYFFINDOR HOUSE

02:20:12.142 --> 02:20:13.666
60 POINTS.

02:20:21.848 --> 02:20:23.284
WE'RE TIED WITH SLYTHERIN!

02:20:23.327 --> 02:20:25.982
AND FINALLY,

02:20:26.026 --> 02:20:28.028
IT TAKES A GREAT DEAL
OF BRAVERY

02:20:28.071 --> 02:20:30.073
TO STAND UP
TO YOUR ENEMIES,

02:20:30.117 --> 02:20:34.077
BUT A GREAT DEAL MORE TO
STAND UP TO YOUR FRIENDS.

02:20:34.121 --> 02:20:39.866
I AWARD 10 POINTS
TO NEVILLE LONGBOTTOM.

02:20:53.227 --> 02:20:56.143
ASSUMING THAT
MY CALCULATIONS ARE CORRECT,

02:20:56.186 --> 02:20:59.625
I BELIEVE THAT
A CHANGE OF DECORATION

02:20:59.668 --> 02:21:01.540
IS IN ORDER.

02:21:07.197 --> 02:21:10.723
GRYFFINDOR
WINS THE HOUSE CUP.

02:21:12.681 --> 02:21:13.943
YES!

02:21:30.351 --> 02:21:31.570
NEVILLE!

02:21:44.887 --> 02:21:47.542
[TRAIN WHISTLE BLOWS]

02:21:48.761 --> 02:21:49.805
COME ON NOW.

02:21:49.849 --> 02:21:52.199
HURRY UP.
YOU'LL BE LATE.

02:21:52.242 --> 02:21:53.330
TRAIN'S LEAVING.
GO ON. GO ON.

02:21:53.374 --> 02:21:55.507
COME ON.
HURRY UP.

02:22:01.861 --> 02:22:03.123
COME ON, HARRY.

02:22:03.166 --> 02:22:05.473
ONE MINUTE.

02:22:11.392 --> 02:22:12.436
THOUGHT YOU WERE
LEAVING

02:22:12.480 --> 02:22:14.526
WITHOUT SAYING
GOOD-BYE, DID YOU?

02:22:19.008 --> 02:22:20.749
THIS IS FOR YOU.

02:22:36.243 --> 02:22:38.158
THANKS, HAGRID.

02:22:43.990 --> 02:22:46.296
GO ON. ON WITH YOU.

02:22:46.340 --> 02:22:47.733
ON WITH YOU NOW.
ON WITH YOU.

02:22:47.776 --> 02:22:49.561
OH, LISTEN, HARRY.

02:22:49.604 --> 02:22:52.346
IF THAT DOLT OF A COUSIN
OF YOURS, DUDLEY,

02:22:52.389 --> 02:22:54.348
GIVES YOU ANY GRIEF,

02:22:54.391 --> 02:22:57.177
YOU COULD ALWAYS,
UM, THREATEN HIM

02:22:57.220 --> 02:22:58.482
WITH A NICE PAIR OF EARS

02:22:58.526 --> 02:23:00.441
TO GO WITH
THAT TAIL OF HIS.

02:23:00.484 --> 02:23:01.877
BUT, HAGRID,

02:23:01.921 --> 02:23:04.576
WE'RE NOT ALLOWED TO DO MAGIC
AWAY FROM HOGWARTS.

02:23:04.619 --> 02:23:05.794
YOU KNOW THAT.

02:23:05.838 --> 02:23:07.491
I DO...

02:23:07.535 --> 02:23:09.624
BUT YOUR COUSIN
DON'T, DO HE?

02:23:09.668 --> 02:23:12.932
EH? [CHUCKLES]

02:23:15.891 --> 02:23:17.676
FEELS STRANGE
TO BE GOING HOME,

02:23:17.719 --> 02:23:19.068
DOESN'T IT?

02:23:19.112 --> 02:23:21.418
I'M NOT GOING HOME.

02:23:21.462 --> 02:23:23.595
NOT REALLY.

02:23:23.638 --> 02:23:26.467
[WHISTLE BLOWS]

02:24:05.637 --> 02:24:08.596
CAPTIONING MADE POSSIBLE BY
WARNER BROS.

02:24:08.640 --> 02:24:11.643
CAPTIONED BY THE NATIONAL
CAPTIONING INSTITUTE
--www.ncicap.org--
